<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Lwaḥi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Waḥ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lwaḥi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lwaḥi n arrasul Yuḥanna</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lwaḥi n arrasul Yuḥanna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s">Lwaḥi iy d iwḥa Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Wanita ḏ lwaḥi n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Yuca-as-ṯ Arebbi ḥima aṯ ismeḍhar i yinni iy ṯ iƹebbḏen. Manaya itxeṣṣa u labud aḏ iwqeƹ ḏeɣya. Lmasiḥ issekk lmalak nnes aḏ ixebbar manaya i ȓƹabḏ nnes qqaren-as Yuḥanna. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />U netta ḏ ccaheḏ x marra min iẓra, iƹni x wawaȓ n Arebbi ḏ minxef icheḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Ssaƹḏ n wenni iy ɣa iɣaren awaȓen n lwaḥi-ya. Ssaƹḏ n yinni ƹaweḏ iy ɣa iṣennṭen i min yurin ḏi Lkitab-a azzayes ggen array ȓaḥeqqac ȓweqṯ ṯqarreb-d.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuḥanna itseǧam x sebƹa n ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Zi Yuḥanna ɣar sebƹa n ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin ḏi lʼiqlim n Asya. Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zeg wenni ig iǧan, tuɣa iǧa, ƹaḏ aḏ d yas. Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa zi sebƹa n arruḥaṯ ig iǧan zzaṯ i lƹarc nnes. <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />U ƹaweḏ akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa zi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, netta ḏ ccaheḏ ḏayes ȓaman. Netta iy d ixeȓqen ḏ amezwaru n yinni iy d itekkaren zi ȓmewṯ, ḏ netta ig iḥekkmen x izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ. Iḥibb-aneɣ, ifekk-aneɣ zi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nneɣ s iḏammen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iḏammen netta ḏ ddem.</char></note> nnes. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Igga zzayneɣ ijjen n lmemlaka ḏ ȓfuqaha i Arebbi Babas. Aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama ḏ ȓeḥkam i netta i ȓebda, amin.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Aqa yusa-d ak useynu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aseynu netta ḏ asegnu.</char></note> aṯ ẓrent marra ṯiṭṭawin ḏ yiwḏan nni iy ṯ icukken. Axas ḥeznen marra ȓqum n ṯmurṯ. Wah, amin.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Iqqar Siḏi Arebbi: "Nec ḏ lʼalif nec ḏ lyaʼ. Nec ḏ wenni ig iǧan, tuɣa ǧiɣ, ƹaḏ aḏ d aseɣ, zemmareɣ i kuȓci."<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Yuḥanna iẓerr Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏi lwaḥi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Nec ḏ Yuḥanna ḏ umaṯwem, cerrceɣ akiḏwem ḏi ȓemḥayen ḏ ȓmulk n Arebbi ḏ ṣṣbar ig iǧan ḏi Ƹisa. Tuɣa ǧiɣ ḏi ṯeyzirṯ n Baṭmus ƹlaḥsab awaȓ n Arebbi ḏ minxef icheḏ Ƹisa. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ḏi nhar n Siḏiṯneɣ tuɣa ihwa-d xafi Arruḥ n Arebbi, sȓiɣ ɣar ḏeffar inu ijjen n ṯmijja ṯemɣar ṣṣut nnes igga am zzammar. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Ṯeqqar-ayi: "Min twaȓiḏ cek ari-ṯ ḏeg yijjen n lkitab, sekk-iṯ ɣar sebƹa n ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus, ḏ Smirna, ḏ Barɣamus, ḏ Ṯiyatra, ḏ Sardis, ḏ Filadalfya, ḏ Lawdukya."<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Nqeȓbeɣ aḏ xzareɣ ɣar ṯmijja nni iy kiḏi d issawaȓen. Wami nqeȓbeɣ ufiɣ sebƹa n ȓeqnaḏeȓ n ddheb. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Ḏi ȓwesṭ n ȓeqnaḏeȓ nni ufiɣ ḏinni ijjen itcabbah ḏi mmis n bnaḏem, ɣares čammir ḏ azeyrar ḥetta aȓ iḍaren nnes. Ɣares ijjen n uḥezzam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aḥezzam-a netta ḏ lwisam.</char></note> n ddheb iqḍeƹ-d zeg uɣiȓ ɣar nneṣṣ. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Acewwaf n uzeǧif nnes ḏ acemȓaȓ igga am ṯaḍufṯ niɣ am uḏfeȓ. Ṯiṭṭawin nnes ggint am can uḥaḏuq n ṯmessi. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Iḍaren nnes tceƹciƹen ggin am nneḥḥas iṣfan am yallah iy d iffɣen zi ȓkuceṯ, ṯmijja nnes ṯegga am ṣṣut n waṭṭas n waman. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Ḏeg ufus nnes afusi ɣares sebƹa n yiṯran. Aqemmum nnes iteffeɣ-d zzayes ijjen n ssif iqḍeƹ x ṯnayen n jjihaṯ. Aɣembub nnes igga am nnur n ṯfuct iy itceƹciƹen aṭṭas.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Wami ṯ ẓriɣ uḍiɣ-as ɣar iḍaren nnes axmi mmuṯeɣ. Isers-d xafi fus nnes afusi inna-ayi: "War teggweḏ ca!" Inna-ayi: "Qa nec ḏ amezwaru ḏ aneggaru. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Nec ḏ wenni iddaren. Tuɣa mmuṯeɣ, ȓexxu nec ddareɣ i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Ɣari ȓemfataḥ n ȓmewṯ ḏ Lʼaxira. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Ari min ṯeẓriḏ, ḏ min itewqiƹen ȓexxu, ḏ min ɣa iweqƹen ssa aȓ ṯsawent. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Min iƹna ȓmaƹna inuffaren n sebƹa n yiṯran nni iy ṯeẓriḏ ḏeg ufus inu afusi ḏ sebƹa nni n ȓeqnaḏeȓ? Sebƹa nni n yiṯran, iƹni niṯni ḏ sebƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ n ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin. Sebƹa nni n ȓeqnaḏeȓ, iƹni niṯni ḏ sebƹa n ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin."<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Ṯabrat i jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />"Ari-yas i lmalaʼika n jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Ufasus, ini-yas qa wenni iy iṭṭfen sebƹa n yiṯran ḏeg ufus nnes afusi, iggur ḏi ȓwesṭ n sebƹa n ȓeqnaḏeȓ n ddheb, iqqar-ac: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Nec ssneɣ ȓexḏayem nnec ḏ tamara nnec ḏ ṣṣbar nnec. Ssneɣ war ṯqebbȓeḏ ca yinni iǧan ḏ iƹeffanan, ṯjarrbeḏ yinni iqqaren qa neccin ḏ arrusul ṯufiḏ-ṯen sxerriqen waha. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Ṯeṣbareḏ, ṯeysiḏ tamara ƹlaḥsab isem inu bȓa ma aḏ taḥȓeḏ. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Walakin ƹeyybeɣ xac wami ṯsemḥeḏ ḏi ȓemḥibbeṯ nnec ṯamezwarut. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Fekkar mecḥaȓ ṯɣelṭeḏ, tub, egg ȓexḏayem nnec ṯimezwura. Meȓa ṯugiḏ aḏ tubeḏ, aḏ d aseɣ ɣarek aḏ ysiɣ ȓqendiȓ nnec zeg umcan nnes. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Walakin ṯeggiḏ mliḥ wami ṯƹiffeḏ ȓexḏayem n inikulaṯen iy ƹiffeɣ uȓa ḏ nec. <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan min iqqar Arruḥ n Arebbi i ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin. Wenni ɣa irebḥen aḏas uceɣ aḏ icc zi ṯcejjarṯ n ṯuḏarṯ iy iǧan ḏi jjenneṯ n Arebbi.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯabrat i jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Smirna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />Ari-yas i lmalaʼika n jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Smirna, ini-yas qa wenni iǧan ḏ amezwaru uȓa ḏ aneggaru,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Min iƹna "Wenni iǧan ḏ amezwaru uȓa ḏ aneggaru"? Manaya issawaȓ x Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa. Kuȓci zzayes ig ibḏa, kuȓci zzayes iy ɣa ikemmeȓ. Xzar uḏem wis 22 ḏ lʼaya wis 13.</char></note> immuṯ uca ikkar-d zi ȓmewṯ, iqqar-ac: <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Nec ssneɣ ȓemḥayen nnec, cek ḏ ȓmeskin walakin lla cek ḏ ttajar! Ssneɣ ȓbaṭeȓ iy xawem qqaren yinni iḥessben ixef nsen zi Ayṯ-Israʼil. Lla, niṯni war ǧin ca zi jmaƹṯ n Ayṯ-Israʼil; Niṯni ɣir ḏ ijjen n jmaƹṯ ig iƹebbḏen Cciṭan. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />War teggweḏ ca zi mammec iy ɣa twaƹeddbeḏ. Aqa Ibȓis aḏ isiḏef ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem ɣar ȓeḥbes ḥima aḏ twajarrbem. Aḏ tseƹḏum ȓemḥayen ḏi ƹecrayyam. Arni ḏi lʼiman nnec waxxa ac nɣen, nec aḏac uceɣ ttaj n ṯuḏarṯ. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan min iqqar Arruḥ n Arebbi i ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin. Wenni ɣa irebḥen, war ṯ tḍarri ca ȓmewṯ nni wis ṯnayen.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯabrat i jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Barɣamus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />Ari-yas i lmalaʼika n jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Barɣamus, ini-yas qa wenni ɣar iǧa ssif iqḍeƹ x ṯnayen n jjihaṯ, iqqar-ac: <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Nec ssneɣ mani ṯzeddɣeḏ, ḏinni lƹarc n Cciṭan. Cek teṭṭfeḏ ḏeg yisem inu. War ṯenkareḏ ca l'iman iy zzayi ṯeggiḏ, waxxa ḏeg wussan nni iy ḏi nɣin ijjen n ccahiḏ inu ḏayes ȓaman qqaren-as Antipas. Nɣin-ṯ zzaṯwem mani izeddeɣ Cciṭan. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Walakin ƹeyybeɣ xac can ṯmesȓayin wami akiḏec can iwḏan iy tbaƹen ttaƹlim n Balƹam. Netta tuɣa iseȓmaḏ-as i Barak mammec ɣa igg ṯaxcebṯ i Ayṯ-Israʼil bac aḏ ccen dbiḥeṯ itqeddamen i lʼaṣnam aḏ fesḏen. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ƹaweḏ akiḏec can yiwḏan iy tbaƹen ttaƹlim n inikulaṯen. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Tub! Meȓa lla, aɣarek d aseɣ ḏeɣya war tƹeṭṭaȓeɣ ca, aḏ ḥarbeɣ iwḏan-a s ssif iy d iteffɣen zeg uqemmum inu. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan min iqqar Arruḥ n Arebbi i ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin. Wenni ɣa irebḥen, aḏas uceɣ aḏ icc aɣrum n lmanna wenni itwasnuffaren. Aḏas uceɣ azru ḏ acemȓaȓ yura ḏayes ijjen n yisem ḏ jḏiḏ war ṯ issin ḥadd illa wenni iy ṯ ɣa iqebȓen.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯabrat i jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Ṯiyatra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />Ari-yas i lmalaʼika n jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Ṯiyatra, ini-yas qa wenni iǧan ḏ Mmis n Arebbi, ṯiṭṭawin nnes ggint am uḥaḏuq n ṯmessi, iḍaren nnes ggin am nneḥḥas iṣfan, iqqar-ac: <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Nec ssneɣ ȓexḏayem nnec ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nnec ḏ lʼiman nnec ḏ ṣṣbar nnec qa ssneɣ ȓexḏayem nnec ṯineggura ktar zi ṯinni ṯimezwura. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Walakin ƹeyybeɣ xac wami ṯejjiḏ Izabil ṯamɣarṯ tarra ixef nnes ḏ nnabiya. Ṯxeddeƹ lƹibad inu, ṯseȓmaḏ-iṯen aḏ fesḏen, aḏ ccen zi dbiḥeṯ itqeddamen i l'aṣnam. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Uciɣ-as ȓweqṯ aḏ ttub zi lfasad nnes, walakin ṯugi aḏ ttub. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />S manayenni at nḍareɣ ḏi ṯassuṯ n ȓeḥȓiq ḏ yinni akiḏes ɣa iznan meȓa war tuben ca zi ȓefƹayeȓ nsen ataf aṯen nḍareɣ ḏi ȓemḥayen. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Aḏ nɣeɣ ṯarwa nnes. Aḏ ssnen marra ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin belli ḏ nec ig itmeyyazen min ḏayes ḏi ȓaƹqeȓ ḏ wuȓ. Kuȓ ijjen zzaywem aḏas uceɣ ƹlaḥsab ȓexḏayem nnes.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Amma kenniw nneɣni iy iǧan ḏi Ṯiyatra war ṯeqbiȓem ca ttaƹlim nni, war ṯessinem ca manayenni umi qqaren yiwḏan &lt;Lʼasrar n Cciṭan yuǧɣen.&gt; Qqareɣ-awem nec war xawem teggeɣ bu ca n dqeȓ nneɣni. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Innama, lʼiman nwem ṭṭfem ḏayes mliḥ waha aȓ d ɣa aseɣ. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="REV 2:26-27" />Wenni ɣa irebḥen ḏ wenni ɣa iṣbaren ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ inu ḥetta aȓ uneggaru aḏas uceɣ nec ssulṭa x ȓegnus, ammec ḏayi ṯemmuc i nec zi Baba: Aṯen yarwes s uƹekkaz n ȓeḥḏiḏ, aṯen irez am iqnucen n ucaȓ. <verse eid="REV 2:26-27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Aḏas uceɣ iṯri n ȓefjar. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan min iqqar Arruḥ n Arebbi i ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Ṯabrat i jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Sardis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />Ari-yas i lmalaʼika n jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Sardis, ini-yas qa wenni ɣar ǧan sebƹa n arruḥaṯ n Arebbi ḏ sebƹa n yiṯran, iqqar-ac: Nec ssneɣ ȓexḏayem nnec. Qqaren qa cek ṯeddareḏ walakin lla cek ṯemmuṯeḏ. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Iȓi ƹlabal, egg jjheḏ nnec ḏi ȓexḏayem nnec iy ḏac iqqimen qbeȓ ma aḏ mmṯent qaƹ. Nec ufiɣ ȓexḏayem nnec war kemmȓent ca zzaṯ i Arebbi inu. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Ƹqeȓ x ttaƹlim iy ṯqebȓeḏ wami ḏas ṯesȓiḏ. Xḏem zzayes, tub. Meȓa war ṯeǧiḏ ca ƹlabal, nec aɣarek d aseɣ am yij uceffar war ṯessineḏ ca man ṯsaƹƹat iy d ɣa aseɣ.<verse eid="REV 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Akiḏec ḏinni ȓebƹaḍ n yiwḏan ḏi Sardis war swesixen ca arruḍ nsen, akiḏi uyuren s warruḍ ḏ acemȓaȓ ȓaḥeqqac sḏaheǧen-t. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Wenni ɣa irebḥen aḏas ggen arruḍ ḏ acemȓaȓ. Nec ƹemmarṣ aḏ mesḥeɣ isem nnes zi Lkitab n Ṯuḏarṯ, axas cehḏeɣ zzaṯ i Baba ḏ lmalaʼikaṯ nnes. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan min iqqar Arruḥ n Arebbi i ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯabrat i jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Filadalfya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />Ari-yas i lmalaʼika n jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Filadalfya, ini-yas qa wenni imqeddsen ḏ ȓḥaqq, ɣares ȓmeftaḥ n Dawed; meȓa irzem ataf war ṯ itbelliƹ ḥadd; meȓa ibelleƹ ataf war ṯ irezzem ḥadd, iqqar-ac: <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Nec ssneɣ ȓexḏayem nnec. Aqa ggiɣ zzaṯec ijjen n ṯewwarṯ ṯnurzem war izemmar ḥadd at ibelleƹ. Waxxa jjheḏ nnec ḏ uqlil, ṯeggiḏ array i wawaȓ inu war ṯenkareḏ ca isem inu. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Amma yinni zi jmaƹṯ iy iƹebbḏen Cciṭan ḥessben ixef nsen zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, walakin niṯni war ǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil sxerriqen waha. Aṯen d arreɣ s bezzez aḏ d asen aḏ sejjḏen ɣar iḍaren nnec aḏ ssnen nec tḥibbiɣ-cek. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Ṯeṣbareḏ x min c weṣṣiɣ, s manaya ataf nec ac ḥmiɣ zi ṯsaƹƹat nni n ȓemḥayen iy d ɣa ihwan x marra ddunect-a ḥima imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ azzayes twajarrben. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Aqa usiɣ-d, war tƹeṭṭaȓeɣ ca. Ṭṭef ḏi lʼiman nnec ḥima war d itis ḥadd ac iysi ttaj nnec. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Qa wenni ɣa irebḥen aṯ sbeddeɣ am yijjen n upilar ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Arebbi inu aḏ iqqim ḏinni i ȓebda. Axas ariɣ isem n Arebbi inu ḏ yisem n ṯendint n Arebbi inu, iƹni Lquds n jḏiḏ iy d ɣa ihwan zeg ujenna zi Arebbi inu. Axas ariɣ isem inu ḏ jḏiḏ. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan min iqqar Arruḥ n Arebbi i ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯabrat i jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin ḏi ṯendint n Lawdukya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />Ari-yas i lmalaʼika n jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Lawdukya, ini-yas qa wenni umi qqaren Amin, netta ḏ ccaheḏ ḏayes ȓaman ḏayes ȓḥaqq, zzayes iy d ixȓeq Arebbi marra, iqqar-ac: <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Nec ssneɣ ȓexḏayem nnec, cek war ṯesmiḍeḏ war ṯeḥmiḏ. Tmenniɣ cek aḏ tsemḍeḏ niɣ aḏ teḥmiḏ! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Acek d ƹuqqeɣ zeg uqemmum inu, cek ṯemȓuḏiḏ waha war ṯeḥmiḏ ca war ṯesmiḍeḏ ca. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Cek ṯeqqareḏ zaƹma qa nec ḏ ijjen n ttajar ggiɣ aṭṭas n wagȓa war ḥḏijeɣ walu. Iwa war ṯessineḏ ca qa cek ḏ amqeṭṭaƹ ḏ ameɣbun, ḏ imesƹi, ḏ aḏarɣaȓ, ḏ aƹeryan. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Qa nec neṣṣḥeɣ-cek axafi ṯesɣeḏ ddheb itwaṣfan s ṯmessi ḥima aḏ tdewȓeḏ ḏ ttajar. Seɣ ƹaweḏ arruḍ ḏ acemȓaȓ ḥima aḏ tesarḍeḏ ixef nnec zi ṯuƹaryant nnec ƹaweḏ ḏ can ddwa ḥima aḏ tesgenfiḏ ṯiṭṭawin nnec ataf twaȓiḏ. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Nec trebbiɣ nehhiɣ marra wenni tḥibbiɣ. Cek lʼiman nnec sejheḏ-iṯ, tub. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Qa nec beddeɣ zzaṯ i ṯewwarṯ sqerqubeɣ. Meȓa isȓa can yijjen i ṯmijja inu qa aḏ irzem ṯawwarṯ, ataf aɣares aḏfeɣ akiḏes cceɣ akiḏi icc. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Wenni ɣa irebḥen aṯ jjeɣ akiḏi iqqim x lƹarc inu, am rebḥeɣ uȓa ḏ nec qqimeɣ ak Baba x lƹarc nnes. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Ṣenneṭ mliḥ, a wenni itsȓan min iqqar Arruḥ n Arebbi i ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin."<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Arebbi itmeḍhar-d x Lƹarc nnes ḏeg ujenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Menbaƹd i manaya ẓriɣ ijjen n ṯewwarṯ ṯnurzem ḏeg ujenna, sȓiɣ i ṯmijja nni iy ɣari d issiwȓen zi qbeȓ ṣṣut nnes igga am zzammar, ṯenna-ayi-d: "Gaƹƹeḏ-d ḏanita aḏac d smeḍhareɣ min labud ɣa iweqƹen menbaƹd i manaya." <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ȓexddenni ihwa-d xafi Arruḥ n Arebbi, imeḍhar-d ḏinni ijjen n lƹarc ḏeg ujenna iqqim xas ijjen. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Wenni xas iqqimen itcabbah ḏi ṯezrut n lyaceb ḏ lƹaqiq azeggwaɣ. Ijjen n ṯesȓiṯ n unẓar ṯenneḍ-as-d i lƹarc-a, tcabbah ḏi ṯezrut ṯazeyzawṯ n zzumurrud. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Nnḍen-as-d i lƹarc-a arbeƹa u ƹicrin n lƹarcaṯ, xasen arbeƹa u ƹicrin n imɣaren ggin arruḍ ḏ acemȓaȓ, kuȓ ijjen zzaysen ɣares ttaj n ddheb x uzeǧif nnes. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Iteffeɣ-d zi lƹarc wassam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Assam netta ḏ ȓebruq.</char></note> ḏ iɣuyan ḏ wajjaj. Zzaṯ i lƹarc ḏinni sebƹa n isfeḍawen n ṯmessi ceƹƹȓen, yina niṯni ḏ sebƹa n arruḥaṯ n Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Zzaṯ i lƹarc ḏinni am ȓebḥar n jjaj iṣfa aṭṭas. Ḏinni arbeƹa n lmexluqaṯ iddaren ḏi ȓwesṭ, nnḍen-as-d i lƹarc ɣarsen ṯiṭṭawin ɣar zzaṯ ḏ ḏeffar. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Lmexluq amezwaru itcabbah ḏi ssbaƹ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ssbaƹ netta ḏ ayraḏ, s ṯeƹrabṯ al-asad.</char></note> Wis ṯnayen itcabbah ḏeg uyenduz. Wis ṯȓaṯa ɣares aɣembub am bnaḏem. Wis arbeƹa itcabbah ḏi nser iṭṭawen. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Kuȓ ijjen zi lmexluqaṯ-a ɣares setta n wafriwen, kuȓ afriw iccur s ṯiṭṭawin x jjihetayen. Qqaren ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar bȓa ma aḏ bedden:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">"Mecḥaȓ ƹaḍim, ƹaḍim, ƹaḍim, Siḏi Arebbi izemmaren i kuȓci.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">Netta ḏ wenni iy tuɣa iǧan, ḏ wenni iy iǧan, ḏ wenni ƹaḏ iy d ɣa yasen."<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Lmexluqaṯ-a meȓmi ma semɣaren tweqqaren ḥemmḏen-as i wenni iqqimen x lƹarc ig iddaren i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />ssenni ƹaweḏ arbeƹa u ƹicrin nni n imɣaren trekkaƹen-as i wenni iqqimen x lƹarc, tsejjaḏen-as i wenni iddaren i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Kuȓ ijjen zzaysen ineṭṭar ttaj nnes zzaṯ i lƹarc iqqar:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />"A Mawlana a Siḏi Arebbi nneɣ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">ḏ cek iy isḏaheǧen lƹaḍama ḏ uweqqar ḏ jjheḏ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">ȓaḥeqqac cek ṯxeȓqeḏ kuȓci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">s ȓxaḍar nnec twaxeȓqen-d aqaṯen ǧan."<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Lkitab nni ḏi yurint lmuṣibaṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Ṯumma ẓriɣ ijjen n Lkitab ḏeg ufus afusi n wenni iqqimen x lƹarc yura ɣar ḏaxeȓ ḏ barra, icemmeƹ sebƹa n marraṯ. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Twaȓiɣ ijjen n lmalak ameqqran iȓaɣa s jjheḏ iqqar: "Wi ɣar iǧa ȓḥaqq aḏ irzem Lkitab-a aḏ ikkes icemmaƹen nnes?" <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Uȓa ḏ ijjen deg ujenna niɣ ḏi ṯmurṯ niɣ swadday i ṯmurṯ war izemmar aḏ irzem Lkitab-a niɣ aḏ ixzar min ḏayes. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Truɣ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issawaȓ ḏanita Yuḥanna iƹni wenni itarin ṯabrat-a.</char></note> aṭṭas ȓaḥeqqac war ufin ḥadd aḏ isḏaheǧ aḏ irzem Lkitab-a aḏayes ixzar. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Ȓexddenni indeq-d ijjen zeg imɣaren nni inna-ayi: "War tru ca! Aqa irbeḥ ssbaƹ nni ig iǧan zi Ayṯ-Yahuḏa lʼaṣel nnes zi Dawed, izemmar aḏ irzem Lkitab-a aḏ ikkes icemmaƹen nni s sebƹa."<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Ṯumma ṭṭarf i lƹarc-a, ḏi ȓwesṭ n arbeƹa n lmexluqaṯ nni ḏ imɣaren nni, ẓriɣ ḏinni ijjen n Yizmar ibedd walakin itban-d axmi ṯ nɣin. Ɣares sebƹa n waccawen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Accawen niṯni ḏ iqaccawen n lḥayawan.</char></note> ḏ sebƹa n ṯiṭṭawin. Niṯni ḏ sebƹa n arruḥaṯ n Arebbi ig issekk ɣar marra ddunect-a. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Yusa-d iysi Lkitab-a zeg ufus afusi n wenni iqqimen x lƹarc. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Wami iysi Lkitab-a, lmexluqaṯ nni s arbeƹa ḏ arbeƹa u ƹicrin n imɣaren nni sejjḏen-as i Yizmar. Mkuȓ ijjen zzaysen ɣares ṯgambrit ɣares ṯimejmarin ggin-ṯent s ddheb ƹemmarent s tbaxur, iƹni ḏ ṯẓaǧiṯ n ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Tɣennajen s yijjen n yizȓi ḏ jḏiḏ qqaren:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">"Ḏ cek iy isḏaheǧen aḏ teysiḏ Lkitab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">aḏ terzmeḏ icemmaƹen nnes,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ȓaḥeqqac twaɣarṣeḏ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ṯesnejmeḏ iwḏan i Arebbi s iḏammen nnec</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">zi mkuȓ ȓqum ḏ lluɣa ḏ ccaƹb ḏ ȓgens.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Ṯeggiḏ zzaysen ijjen n lmemlaka n ȓfuqaha i Arebbi nneɣ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">aḏ ḥekkmen ḏi ṯmurṯ."<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Ṯumma xzareɣ, sȓiɣ i ṯmijja n waȓaf n uȓufaṯ ḏ milyun n milyunaṯ n lmalaʼikaṯ tennḍent-as-d i lƹarc ḏ lmexluqaṯ ḏ imɣaren. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Qqarent s jjheḏ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">"Izmar itwanɣen isḏaheǧ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ṯizemmar ḏ wagȓa ḏ lḥikma ḏ jjheḏ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">ḏ uweqqar ḏ lƹaḍama ḏ lḥamed."<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Ṯumma sȓiɣ i kuȓ lmexluq iǧan ḏeg ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ ḏ swadday i ṯmurṯ ḏ ȓebḥar ḏ marra min ḏaysen qqaren-asen i wenni iqqimen x lƹarc uȓa ḏ Yizmar: "Aɣarwem yiȓi lḥamed ḏ uweqqar ḏ lƹaḍama ḏ ȓeḥkam i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ!"<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Lmexluqaṯ nni s arbeƹa qqaren: "Amin!" Rekƹen imɣaren nni aḏ sejjḏen.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Sebƹa nni n icemmaƹen x Lkitab n Lmuṣibaṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ṯumma ẓriɣ Izmar nni wami irzem ijjen zi sebƹa n icemmaƹen nni, sȓiɣ i yijjen zi arbeƹa nni n lmexluqaṯ iqqar s jjheḏ am wajjaj: "Araḥ-d!" <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Wami xzareɣ, twaȓiɣ ijjen n uyis ḏ acemȓaȓ, wenni xas inyin ɣares ijjen n neccab n fȓiča. Ucin-as ijjen n ttaj, iffeɣ irebbeḥ ḏi ȓḥarb u ƹaḏ aḏ irbeḥ.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Izmar nni wami irzem acemmaƹ wis ṯnayen, sȓiɣ i lmexluq wis ṯnayen iqqar: "Araḥ-d!" <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Ṯumma iffeɣ-d ijjen n uyis ḏ azeggwaɣ, wenni xas inyin ucin-as aḏ ikkes ssalam zi ṯmurṯ, aḏ nɣen yiwḏan ayawya. Ƹaweḏ ucin-as ijjen n ssif ḏ ameqqran.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Izmar nni wami irzem acemmaƹ wis ṯȓaṯa, sȓiɣ i lmexluq wis ṯȓaṯa iqqar: "Araḥ-d!" Wami xzareɣ, twaȓiɣ ijjen n uyis ḏ abercan, wenni xas inyin ɣares ȓmizan ḏeg ufus nnes. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Ṯumma sȓiɣ amecnaw ijjen n ṯmijja ṯusa-d zi jjiheṯ n arbeƹa n lmexluqaṯ nni ṯeqqar: "Kilu n yirḏan iseggwa nhar ufeǧaḥ. Ƹaweḏ ṯȓaṯa n kilu n imendi iseggwa nhar ufeǧaḥ. Walakin zzect ḏ waman uḍiȓ war ṯen tḍeyyaƹ ca."<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Izmar nni wami irzem acemmaƹ wis arbeƹa, sȓiɣ i lmexluq wis arbeƹa iqqar: "Araḥ-d!" <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Wami xzareɣ, twaȓiɣ ijjen n uyis ḏ awraɣ, wenni xas inyin semman-ṯ Ȓmewṯ, teḏfar-iṯ Lʼaxira. Ṯemmuc-asen ssulṭa aḏ nɣen arbaƹ n imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ s ssif ḏ jjuƹ ḏ ṭṭaƹun ḏ ȓuḥuc n ṯmurṯ.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Izmar nni wami irzem acemmaƹ wis xemsa, ẓriɣ swadday i ȓmeḏbaḥ buḥbeȓ n yinni itwanɣen ƹlaḥsab awaȓ n Arebbi ḏ chaḏeṯ iy cehḏen. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ nnan: "Ya Mawlana ya wenni ƹaḍim iǧan ḏ ȓḥaqq, mecḥaȓ ɣa ṯekkeḏ war tḥisibeḏ imezḏaɣ n ddunect-a, aṯen ṯƹaqbeḏ x iḏammen nneɣ?" <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Ṯumma immuc-asen marra ij-ij, čammir ḏ acemȓaȓ itwanna-yasen ƹaḏ aḏ teṣbarem cwayt aȓ ɣa itwakemmeȓ lƹadad nican n ayṯmaṯwem iy ɣa itwanɣen amecnaw kenniw, iƹni yinni iy iƹebbḏen am kenniw.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Ẓriɣ Izmar nni wami irzem acemmaƹ wis setta, ȓexddenni iwqeƹ ijjen n zzinzal ḏ ameqqran. Ṯfuct ṯeḏweȓ ḏ ṯabercant am ȓefḥam, ṯaziri ṯeḏweȓ am iḏammen. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Iṯran n ujenna weṭṭan-d ɣar ṯmurṯ amecnaw ṯazarṯ xmi ṯweṭṭa zi ṯcejjarṯ xmi t isenhezza arriḥ ijehḏen. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Ajenna inejmeƹ am mammec itwabelleƹ ijjen n lkitab. Iḏurar ḏ ṯeyzirin marra nhezzent zeg umcan nsent.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Kkaren izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ ḏ imeqqranen nsen ḏ arruyas n ȓƹaskar ḏ twajar ḏ yinni ijehḏen ḏ yinni ɣarsen bab nsen ḏ yinni ɣarsen lḥurriya nsen, ruḥen marra tnuffaren ḏeg yifran ḏ jar yizra n iḏurar. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Niṯni qqaren i iḏurar ḏ yizra: "Wḍam-d xaneɣ, snuffarem-aneɣ zeg wuḏem n wenni iqqimen x lƹarc ḏ lƹiqab iy ɣa igg Yizmar. <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Aqa yusa-d Lyawm ameqqran n lƹiqab nsen, ug izemmaren aḏ ibedd?"<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Arebbi iḍebbeƹ miyya u arbeƹa u arbeƹin aȓaf n yiwḏan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Menbaƹd i manaya ẓriɣ arbeƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ beddent x arbeƹa n ṯɣemmura n ṯmurṯ, ṭṭfent arriḥ x arbeƹa n jjihaṯ n ṯmurṯ ḥima war itṣuḍ ca x ȓbarr uȓa x ȓebḥar uȓa x ȓcejjur. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n lmalak nneɣni itgaƹƹaḏ-d zi ccarq iysi-d ṭṭabaƹ n Arebbi iddaren, iȓaɣa s yijjen n ṯmijja ṯejheḏ i arbeƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ nni ṯinni umi immuc jjheḏ ḥima aḏ ḍeyyƹent ȓbarr ḏ ȓebḥar. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />Inna-asent: "War tḍeyyaƹent ni ȓbarr ni ḏ ȓebḥar ni ḏ ȓcejjur ḥetta ɣa neḍbaƹ ṯanyarṯ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯanyarṯ nettaṯ ḏ ṯawarna.</char></note> n yinni iƹebbḏen Arebbi." <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Sȓiɣ i mecḥaȓ itwaḍebƹen: Miyya u arbeƹa u arbeƹin aȓaf zi marra ṯiqebbaȓ n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Yahuḏa, ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Rabin, ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Jad, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Ƹacur, ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Naftali, ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Manasi, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Cimƹun, ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Lawi, ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Cakir, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Zafulun, ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Yusef, ṯenƹacar aȓaf zi Ayṯ-Benyamin.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aṭṭas n ȓɣaci s warruḍ ḏ acemȓaȓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Menbaƹd i manaya xzareɣ, twaȓiɣ aṭṭas n ȓɣaci bȓa ȓeḥsab zi mkuȓ ȓgens ḏ ȓqum ḏ ccaƹb ḏ lluɣa, bedden zzaṯ i lƹarc ḏ zzaṯ i Yizmar ggin čammir ḏ acemȓaȓ, ḏeg ifassen nsen ṯaseṭṭa n tmar. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Snekkaren ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ qqaren: "Arebbi nneɣ ig iqqimen x lƹarc netta ḏ Yizmar ɣarsen ṯizemmar aḏaneɣ snejmen."<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Marra lmalaʼikaṯ beddent nnḍent-id i lƹarc ḏ imɣaren ḏ arbeƹa n lmexluqaṯ nni. Hwant x uɣembub nsent zzaṯ i lƹarc sejjḏent i Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />Qqarent: "Amin! Lḥamed ḏ lƹaḍama ḏ lḥikma ḏ ccuker ḏ uweqqar ḏ ṯzemmar ḏ jjheḏ i Arebbi nneɣ i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin!"<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Inna-ayi yijjen zeg imɣaren-a: "Ma ṯessneḏ yiwḏan-a iy ggin čammir ḏ acemȓaȓ min ƹnan ḏ manis d usin?"<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Jawbeɣ-ṯ nniɣ-as: "Ḏ cek iy issnen a Siḏi."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Inna-ayi: "Yina ḏ yinni inejmen zi ȓmiḥneṯ ṯameqqrant, ṣebbnen ičammiren nsen s iḏammen n Yizmar arrin-ṯen ḏ icemȓaȓen. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />S manaya aqaṯen zzaṯ i lƹarc n Arebbi, ƹebbḏen-ṯ ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant nnes. Wenni iqqimen x lƹarc aṯen iḥḍa. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />War tȓizin war tfiḏin, war ṯen tsecmiḍ ṯfuct uȓa ḏ ȓeḥmu. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Ȓaḥeqqac Izmar iy iǧan ḏi ȓwesṭ n lƹarc aṯen yarwes, aṯen yawi akiḏes ɣar mani ǧan ȓaƹnaṣer n waman n ṯuḏarṯ. Arebbi aḏ imseḥ kuȓ ameṭṭaw zi ṯiṭṭawin nsen."<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Acemmaƹ wis sebƹa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Izmar wami irzem acemmaƹ wis sebƹa, ineqḍeƹ ȓḥess ḏeg ujenna can uzyen n ṯsaƹƹat. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Ẓriɣ sebƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ iy itbeddan zzaṯ i Arebbi, immuc-asent sebƹa n zzwammar.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Yusa-d ijjen n lmalak nneɣni ibedd ɣar ȓmeḏbaḥ, iysi-d ṯimejmarṯ nni itwaṣenƹen s ddheb. Immuc-as aṭṭas n tbaxur ḥima aḏ iqeddem tbaxur nni ak ṯẓaǧiṯ n ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin x ȓmeḏbaḥ n ddheb iǧan zzaṯ i lƹarc. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Ddexxan n tbaxur-a ak ṯẓaǧiṯ n ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin igaƹƹeḏ zeg ufus n lmalak-a wanita ɣar ujenna zzaṯ i Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Iysi lmalak-a ṯimejmarṯ nni n tbaxur, iƹemmar-it s ṯmessi n ȓmeḏbaḥ, izeǧeƹ-it ɣar ṯmurṯ. Iwqeƹ wajjaj ḏ iɣuyan ḏ wassam ḏ zzinzal.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sebƹa n zzwammar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Sebƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ nni iy ɣar ǧant sebƹa n zzwammar sewjaḏent ixef nsent ḥima aḏaysen ṣuḍent. <verse eid="REV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika ṯamezwarut ṯṣuḍ ḏi zzammar nnes uca yusa-d icarra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Icarra netta ḏ aḵarra.</char></note> ḏ ṯmessi mxellṭen ak iḏammen menḍaren ɣar ṯmurṯ. Ṯecmeḍ tuluṯ n ṯmurṯ ḏ tuluṯ n ȓcejjur ḏ marra arbiƹ azeyza.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis ṯnayen ṯṣuḍ ḏi zzammar nnes uca ṯmenḍar-d can ȓḥajeṯ ḏi ȓebḥar amecnaw can uḏrar ḏ ameqqran itceƹƹaȓ s ṯmessi. Tuluṯ n ȓebḥar iḏweȓ ḏ iḏammen. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Tuluṯ n lmexluqaṯ ig itƹican ḏi ȓebḥar mmuṯen, tuluṯ n iɣarruba twarzen.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis tȓaṯa ṯṣuḍ ḏi zzammar nnes uca iwḍa-d ijjen n yiṯri ḏ ameqqran zeg ujenna itceƹƹaȓ amecnaw asfeḍ. Iwḍa-d x tuluṯ n yiɣzran ḏ ȓaƹnaṣer n waman. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Iṯri nni qqaren-as Cciḥ. Tuluṯ n waman nni ḏewȓen ḏ imerzagen. Aṭṭas zeg yinni iswin zzaysen mmuṯen minzi aman nni ḏ imarzagen.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis arbeƹa ṯṣuḍ ḏi zzammar nnes uca tuluṯ n ṯfucṯ ḏ ṯziri ḏ yiṯran twasenhezzen ḥima tuluṯ nni aḏ tiȓi ḏ ṯaǧesṯ, aḏ tenqes ijjen n tuluṯ n ṯfawṯ ḏi nhar uȓa ḏ ǧiȓeṯ. <verse eid="REV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Xzareɣ, sȓiɣ i yijjen n nser iṭṭaw ḏi ȓwesṭ n ujenna iȓaɣa s jjheḏ inna: "Ya tamara, ya tamara, ya tamara x imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ ƹlaḥsab ṯȓaṯa n lmalaʼikaṯ nni ig iqqimen ƹaḏ war ṣuḍent ca ḏi zzwammar nsent."<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis xemsa ṯṣuḍ ḏi zzammar nnes uca ẓriɣ ijjen n yiṯri tuɣa iwḍa-d zeg ujenna x ṯmurṯ. Immuc-as <char style="it">i yiṯri nni</char> ȓmeftaḥ n wanu nni itawin ɣar ȓaǧeɣ bȓa ȓaḥedd. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Irzem anu nni itawin ɣar ȓaǧeɣ bȓa ȓaḥedd, yuȓi-d zzayes ddexxan amecnaw ddexxan n yijjen n ȓkuceṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant. Ddexxan n ȓaǧeɣ nni iɣeṭṭa ṯfucṯ ḏ ljuw. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Zi ddexxan-a ṯeffeɣ-d ssenni ṯmurɣi ɣar ṯmurṯ, immuc-asent jjheḏ am ṯɣirḏemiwin n ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Nnan-asent war tḍeyyaƹent arbiƹ n ṯmurṯ uȓa ḏ min iǧan ḏ azeyza uȓa ḏ ȓcejjur, ɣir iwḏan nni iy war ɣar iǧi ca ṭṭabaƹ n Arebbi x ṯenyarṯ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯanyarṯ nettaṯ ḏ ṯawarna.</char></note> nsen. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Maci mesmuḥ aṯen nɣent, walakin aṯen ƹeddbent xems chur. Ȓaƹḏab-a iy teggent amecnaw ṯiɣirḏemiwin xmi teqqsent i bnaḏem. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni aḏ arzun yiwḏan x ȓmewṯ war t tifen ca, aḏ ttaren ȓmewṯ azzaysen ṯarweȓ.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Ṯmurɣi-ya tcabbah ḏeg yiysan nni iy wejḏen aḏ ḥarben. Ɣarsent x izeǧifen nsent am ttaj n ddheb, aɣembub nsent am uɣembub n bnaḏem. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Ɣarsent acewwaf amecnaw acewwaf n ṯemɣarin. Ṯiɣmas nsent amecnaw ṯiɣmas n ssbaƹ. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Ṯijiliṯin nsent ggint am ṯjiliṯin n ȓeḥḏiḏ. Ssdaƹ n wafriwen nsent igga am ssdaƹ n waṭṭas n ikarruṯen n yiysan iy tazzȓen ɣar ȓḥarb. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Ɣarsent ṯicceṭ am ṯenni n ṯɣirḏent, teqqsent zzayes. Ɣarsent jjheḏ aḏ ḍarrent iwḏan xems chur s ṯicceṭ nni. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Azeǧiḏ nsent netta ḏ lmalak n ȓaǧeɣ bȓa ȓaḥedd, s lƹibriya qqaren-as Abaddun, s ṯyunaniṯ qqaren-as Abulyun.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Ṯeƹḏu tamara ṯamezwarut, ƹaḏ aḏ d asent ṯnayen nneɣni.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis setta ṯṣuḍ ḏi zzammar nnes uca sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja ṯendeq-d zi arbeƹa nni n waccawen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Accawen niṯni ḏ iqaccawen n lḥayawan.</char></note> n ȓmeḏbaḥ n ddheb iy iǧan zzaṯ i Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Ṯenna-as ṯmijja nni i lmalaʼika wis setta iy ɣar ṯeǧa zzammar: "Ḍȓeq-d i arbeƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ itwacedden ḏeg yiɣzar n Lfurat ameqqran." <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Uca twaḍeȓqent-id arbeƹa-ya n lmalaʼikaṯ iy tuɣa twassewjḏent i ṯsaƹƹat-a ḏ nhar-a ḏ char-a ḏ useggwas-a ḥima aḏ nɣent tuluṯ n yiwḏan. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Sȓiɣ x lƹadad n ȓƹaskar iy inyin x yiysan: lƹadad nsen miyyatayen milyun.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ẓriɣ ḏi lwaḥi-ya inu iysan ḏ yinni xasen inyin, ɣarsen ṯijiliṯin n ȓeḥḏiḏ ḏ ṯizeggwaɣin am ṯmessi, ḏ ṯizeyzawin am lyaqut, ḏ ṯiwraɣin am ȓekbriyeṯ. Izeǧifen n yiysan-a am uzeǧif n ssbaƹ, teffeɣ-d zeg uqemmum nsen ṯmessi ḏ ddexxan ḏ ȓekbriyeṯ. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Mmuṯen tuluṯ n yiwḏan s ṯraṯa n lmuṣibaṯ-a iƹni s ṯmessi ḏ ddexxan ḏ ȓekbriyeṯ iy d iteffɣen zeg uqemmum nsen. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Jjheḏ n yiysan-a aqaṯ ḏeg uqemmum nsen ḏ iƹennaben nsen. Iƹennaben nsen tcabbahen ḏeg ifiɣeran, tḍarran s izeǧifen nsen.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Walakin iwḏan ig inejmen zi lmuṣibaṯ-a war tuben ca s min ggin s ifassen nsen. Qqimen ƹaḏ ƹebbḏen ccayaṭin ḏ lʼaṣnam n ddheb ḏ nnuqarṯ ḏ nneḥḥas ḏ uzru ḏ ukeccuḍ iy war itwiȓin ca iy war itsȓin ca iy war igguren ca. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />War tuben ca wami nɣin iwḏan niɣ wami ggin ssḥur ḏ lfasad ḏ ṯukkarda.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Lmalak ak Lkitab Amezyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n lmalak nneɣni ijheḏ ihwa-d zeg ujenna, inneḍ-as-d useynu. X uzeǧif nnes ijjen n ṯesȓiṯ n unẓar, aɣembub nnes igga am ṯfuct, iḍaren nnes ggin am ipilaren n ṯmessi. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Iysi ḏeg ufus nnes ijjen n lkitab ḏ amezyan irzem. Isers ḍar nnes afusi x ȓebḥar, ƹaweḏ ḏ ḍar nnes aẓeȓmaḍ x ȓbarr. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Isɣuy s jjheḏ axmi ihirriw ijjen n ssbaƹ. Wami isɣuy, arrin-d xas sebƹa n wajjajen s ṣṣut nsen. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Wami d arrin sebƹa nni n wajjajen, nec xseɣ aḏ ariɣ manayenni walakin sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja zeg ujenna ṯenna-ayi-d: "Lla, min nnan sebƹa-ya n wajjajen ejj-iṯ ɣarek ḏ ssirr, war ṯ tari ca."<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Ẓriɣ lmalak nni ibedden x ȓebḥar ḏ ȓbarr iysi fus nnes afusi ɣar ujenna. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Ijjuǧ s wenni iddaren i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ iƹni wenni iy d ixeȓqen ajenna ḏ min ḏayes ḏ ȓbarr ḏ ȓebḥar ḏ min ḏaysen. Uca inna: "Ṣafi, war ṯeqqim bu ȓweqṯ ƹaḏ ktar. <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Aqa ḏi nhuraṯ nni xmi ɣa ṯṣuḍ lmalaʼika wis sebƹa ḏi zzammar nnes qa ṣafi ssirr n Arebbi ikemmeȓ mammec ḏasen ṯ iƹaweḏ i lƹibad nnes lʼanbiya."<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Ṯmijja nni umi sȓiɣ zeg ujenna zi qbeȓ ṯendeq-d ƹaweḏ ṯessiweȓ-d akiḏi wis marrṯayen ṯenna-ayi-d: "Ruḥ, ysi lkitab nni irezmen ḏeg ufus n lmalak ig ibedden x ȓebḥar ḏ ȓbarr."<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Ruḥeɣ ɣar lmalak nni nniɣ-as: "Uc-ayi-d Lkitab nni amezyan!" Inna-ayi: "Aqaṯ, ecc-iṯ. Aḏ yiȓi ḏeg uƹeddis nnec ḏ amerzag, walakin ḏeg uqemmum nnec netta ḏ miziḍ am ṯamment." <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Ysiɣ Lkitab nni amezyan zeg ufus nnes, cciɣ-ṯ. Ufiɣ-ṯ ḏeg uqemmum inu ḏ miziḍ am ṯamment. Walakin wami ṯ seɣȓiɣ iḏweȓ ḏ amerzag ḏeg uƹeddis inu. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ȓexddenni itwanna-ayi: "U labud aḏ tessiwȓeḏ ƹaweḏ s min iwḥa Arebbi x waṭṭas n ccuƹub ḏ ȓegnus ḏ lluɣaṯ ḏ izeǧiḏen."<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Ṯnayen n ȓechuḏ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Immuc-ayi ijjen n uɣanim am ḏ ȓaƹbar inna-ayi yijjen: "Kkar, ƹbar ṯamziḏa ṯameqqrant n Arebbi ḏ ȓmeḏbaḥ, ḥseb mecḥaȓ iy ƹebbḏen ḏinni. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Walakin ȓemraḥ iǧan ɣar barra i ṯemziḏa ejj-iṯ waḥḏes, war ṯ teƹbar ca ȓaḥeqqac immuc-asen i ȓegnus. Aḏ ƹeffsen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ƹeffes ixes aḏ yini "ƹjen."</char></note> ṯandint iqeddsen ḏi ṯnayen u arbeƹin n churaṯ. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Aḏ ssekkeɣ ṯnayen n ȓechuḏ inu aḏ ggen arruḍ n lḥuzen aḏ xbaren iwḏan s min ƹeȓmen zi Arebbi aȓaf u miyyatayen u settin yum." <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Ȓechuḏ nni niṯni ḏ ṯnayen n ȓcejjur n zzitun, u ƹaweḏ niṯni ḏ ṯnayen n ȓeqnaḏeȓ ig ibedden zzaṯ i Siḏi Arebbi n ddunect-a. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Meȓa can yijjen irzu aḏ iḍarr ȓechuḏ nni, ataf aḏ teffeɣ ṯmessi zeg uqemmum nsen aḏ tecc ȓƹaḏyan nsen. Meȓa can yijjen irzu aṯen iḍarr, amenni iy ɣa immeṯ. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Ḏi ȓiyamaṯ nni iy ḏi ɣa xbaren ȓechuḏ-a s min ƹeȓmen zi Arebbi ataf aɣarsen ṯiȓi ssulṭa zi ɣa bellƹen ajenna war d icciṯ bu unẓar qaƹ. Ataf ƹaweḏ aɣarsen ṯiȓi ssulṭa aḏ arren aman ḏ iḏammen aḏ ḍeȓqen i marra lmuṣibaṯ x ṯmurṯ meȓmi ma xsen.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Xmi ɣa kemmȓen ȓexbar nsen iy zi ɣa cehḏen, aḏ d igaƹƹeḏ ȓwaḥc zi ȓaǧeɣ bȓa ȓaḥedd aṯen iḥareb, aṯen iɣȓeb, aḏ ineɣ ȓechuḏ nni. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Aḏ teqqim ddat nsen ḏi ccariƹ n ṯendint ṯameqqrant umi qqaren s ȓmaƹna Sadum niɣ Miṣra iƹni mani itwaṣelleb Siḏiṯsen. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Iwḏan zi mkuȓ ccaƹb ḏ ȓqum ḏ lluɣa ḏ ȓgens aḏaysen xzaren ḏi ddat nsen ṯeȓtiyyam ḏ uzyen, war tejjin ḥadd aḏ inḍeȓ ȓechuḏ-a. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ aḏ farḥen aḏ zhun s ȓmewṯ nsen. Aḏ ucen ikaduṯen i wayawya ȓaḥeqqac lʼanbiya nni s ṯnayen, <char style="it">iƹni ȓechuḏ nni</char>, ƹeddben aṭṭas imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Wami ṯeƹḏu ṯeȓtiyyam ḏ uzyen nni, yuḏef ḏaysen ijjen n buḥbeȓ zi Arebbi ḏi ȓechuḏ-a, kkaren bedden x iḍaren nsen. Yinni ṯen iẓrin ṯuḏef ḏaysen ṯiggwḏi ḏ ṯameqqrant. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Sȓin i yijjen n ṯmijja ṯejheḏ tȓaɣa-d xasen zeg ujenna ṯeqqar-asen: "Gaƹƹḏem-d ḏanita!" Ȓechuḏ nni gaƹƹḏen ɣar ujenna ḏeg useynu, ȓƹaḏyan nsen xzaren ḏaysen. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni iwqeƹ ijjen n zzinzal ḏ ameqqran, ṯnehḏem ƹecra ḏi miyya zi ṯendint. Mmuṯen ḏi zzinzal-a sebƹaȓaf n yiwḏan. Yinni iqqimen ggwḏen, bḏan semɣaren Arebbi ig iǧan ḏeg ujenna. <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Ṯeƹḏu tamara wis ṯnayen, ṯenni wis ṯȓaṯa ƹȓayen aḏ d tas.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zzammar wis sebƹa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis sebƹa ṯṣuḍ ḏi zzammar nnes, uca ṯimijjawin ḏeg ujenna qqarent s jjheḏ: "Iḏweȓ ȓeḥkam n ddunect-a ḏeg ifassen n Siḏi Arebbi nneɣ ḏ Lmasiḥ nnes, aḏ iḥkem i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ." <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Kkaren arbeƹa u ƹicrin nni imɣaren iy qqimen x lƹarcaṯ nsen zzaṯ i Arebbi, hwan x uɣembub nsen sejjḏen-as i Arebbi, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />qqaren:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">"Netcekkar-icek a Siḏi Arebbi ig izemmaren i kuȓci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">cek ig iǧan, cek iy tuɣa iǧan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">ȓaḥeqqac ṯesxeḏmeḏ jjheḏ nnec, ṯebḏiḏ tḥekkmeḏ.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Ȓegnus ɣeḍben, yuweḍ-d uɣḍab nnec.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Yuweḍ-d Nhar n Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab n yinni immuṯen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Aḏ tjaziḏ yinni ḏac ixeddmen iƹni lʼanbiya ḏ ȓmuminin nnec ṣṣaliḥin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ḏ yinni itweqqaren isem nnec s imezyanen ḏ imeqqranen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Aḏ teqḍiḏ x yinni isefsaḏen ṯamurṯ."<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ṯnurzem ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Arebbi ḏeg ujenna, imeḍhar-d tabut<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tabut netta ḏ ijjen n ṣṣenduq ukeccuḍ icellel s ddheb. Ḏayes can ṯmesȓayin zi zman n Siḏna Musa.</char></note> n ȓƹaheḏ n Arebbi ḏi ṯemziḏa nni. Iwqeƹ wassam ḏ iɣuyan ḏ wajjaj ḏ zzinzal ḏ icarra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Icarra netta ḏ aḵarra.</char></note> aṭṭas.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Ṯamɣarṯ u ḏ ijjen n ȓwaḥc am ddaynaṣur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Ṯmeḍhar-d ijjen n lƹalama ḏeg ujenna ḏ ṯameqqrant, iƹni ṯamɣarṯ ṯenneḍ-as-d ṯfuct, swadday iḍaren nnes ṯaziri, x uzeǧif nnes ijjen n ttaj ḏayes ṯenƹac n yiṯran. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Aqat s uƹeddis ṯesɣuyiw s ȓeḥriq n ṯarwa, tƹeddab u nettaṯ tarew. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Ṯmeḍhar-d ḏeg ujenna ijjen n lƹalama nneɣni ṯegga am ddaynaṣur ḏ ameqqran ḏ azeggwaɣ ɣares sebƹa n izeǧifen ḏ ƹecra n waccawen,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Accawen niṯni ḏ iqaccawen n lḥayawan.</char></note> ḏ sebƹa n ttajaṯ x izeǧifen nnes. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Ijarr s uƹennab nnes tuluṯ n yiṯran ujenna, inḍar-iṯen ɣar ṯmurṯ. Ibedd bu-sebƹa-ya izeǧifen zzaṯ i ṯemɣarṯ nni u nettaṯ tarew ḥima xmi ṯ ɣa ṯarew aḏas icc mmis. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Ṯurew-d aḥenjir ḏ awṯem u ḏ netta iy ɣa yarewsen marra ȓegnus s uƹekkaz n ȓeḥḏiḏ. Ssenni itwarfaƹ ɣar Arebbi ɣar lƹarc nnes. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Ṯamɣarṯ-a ṯarweȓ ɣar ȓexȓa mani ḏas isewjeḏ Arebbi amcan at seccen ḏinni aȓaf u miyyatayen u settin yum.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Iwqeƹ ȓḥarb ḏeg ujenna. Mikaʼil ḏ lmalaʼikaṯ nnes ḥarben bu-sebƹa izeǧifen. Bu-sebƹa-ya izeǧifen ḏ ccayaṭin nnes ḥarben ƹaweḏ uȓa ḏ niṯni. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />War ḏasent zemmaren i lmalaʼikaṯ nni, bu-sebƹa-ya izeǧifen ḏ ccayaṭin nnes ḍeyyƹen amcan nsen ḏeg ujenna. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Imenḍar-d <char style="it">zeg ujenna</char> bu-sebƹa-ya izeǧifen ameqqran, iƹni fiɣer nni ḏi zman wenni umi qqaren Ibȓis niɣ ḏ Cciṭan iƹni wenni ixeddƹen marra ddunect. Imenḍar-d ɣar ṯmurṯ, menḍaren-d akiḏes ccayaṭin nnes.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja ḏeg ujenna ṯeqqar s jjheḏ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 12:10">"Ȓexxu Arebbi nneɣ isenjam, imeḍhar-d jjheḏ ḏ ȓmulk nnes, ḏ ssulṭa n Lmasiḥ nnes. Ȓaḥeqqac wenni iceṯcan zeg ayṯmaṯneɣ imenḍar-d ɣar ṯmurṯ, ḏ netta ig iceṯcan zzaysen ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar ɣar Arebbi nneɣ.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Ɣeȓben-ṯ ayṯmaṯneɣ s iḏammen n Yizmar ḏ chaḏeṯ nsen. Ṯuḏarṯ nsen war xasen ṯƹizz ca, wejḏen aḏ mmṯen.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />X manaya, fareḥ ay Ajenna, ḏ yinni ḏayes izeddɣen! Walakin ya tamara x <char style="it">imezḏaɣ n</char> ȓbarr ḏ ȓebḥar! Ibȓis ihwa-d ɣarwem iɣḍeb aṭṭas, minzi issen ṯeqqim-as ḏrus n ȓweqṯ."<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Wami bu-sebƹa izeǧifen yufa ixef nnes imenḍar-d ɣar ṯmurṯ, ikkar yuzzeȓ x ṯemɣarṯ nni iy d ijjin awṯem. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Ṯamɣarṯ nni mmucen-as ṯnayen n wafriwen n nser ameqqran ḥima azzaysen ṯḍew ɣar ȓexȓa ɣar umcan nnes, mani ɣa twaƹṯeq ṯeȓt-snin ḏ uzyen ḏi ȓaman zeg ufiɣer nni. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Isufeɣ-d ufiɣer zeg uqemmum nnes aman amecnaw iɣzar tazzȓen x ṯemɣarṯ ḥima at awin waman nni. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Walakin ṯamurṯ ṯsenjem ṯamɣarṯ nni, ṯerzem aqemmum nnes ṯseɣȓi iɣzar iy d isufeɣ bu-sebƹa izeǧifen zeg uqemmum nnes. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Iɣḍeb bu-sebƹa izeǧifen x ṯemɣarṯ nni iruḥ aḏ iḥareb s min iqqimen zi ddurriṯ nnes, iƹni yinni iteggen array s ȓuṣiyaṯ n Arebbi teṭṭfen x minxef icheḏ Ƹisa. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Ṯumma ibedd x yijḏi n ȓebḥar.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Ȓwaḥc iy d iteffɣen zi ȓebḥar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n ȓwaḥc iffeɣ-d zi ȓebḥar, ɣares sebƹa n iqeyyuƹen ḏ ƹecra n waccawen,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Accawen niṯni ḏ iqaccawen n lḥayawan.</char></note> x waccawen nnes ƹecra n ttajaṯ. Urin x iqeyyuƹen nnes isemawen war iḥȓin x Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Ȓwaḥc-a iy ẓriɣ itcabbah ḏeg uɣiȓas,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aɣiȓas netta ḏ nnamir.</char></note> iḍaren nnes ggin am iḍaren n ddub, aqemmum nnes igga am uqemmum n ssbaƹ. Wenni iǧan am ddaynaṣur yuca-as i ȓwaḥc-a jjheḏ nnes ḏ lƹarc nnes ḏ ijjen n ssulṭa ṯemɣar. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Ijjen zeg iqeyyuƹen nnes iḍhar-d ḏayes ij ujarriḥ axmi immuṯ, walakin igenfa zeg ujarriḥ nni n ȓmewṯ. U marra imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ tƹejjben, ḏeffaren ȓwaḥc-a. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Sejjḏen-as yiwḏan i wenni iggin am ddaynaṣur ȓaḥeqqac yuca-as i ȓwaḥc-a ssulṭa nnes. Ƹaweḏ sejjḏen-as i ȓwaḥc-a nnan: "Uw ɣa yiȓin am ȓwaḥc-a? Ug izemmaren aṯ iḥareb?"<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Immuc-as uqemmum i ȓwaḥc-a iy zi ɣa issiweȓ s ttakebbur ḏ wawaȓ war iḥȓin x Arebbi. Ṯemmuc-as ssulṭa iy zi ɣa ixḏem ṯnayen u arbeƹin n churaṯ. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Ibḏa issawaȓ s wawaȓ war iḥȓin x Arebbi, iƹni s wawaȓ war iḥȓin x yisem nnes ḏ ṯzeddiɣṯ nnes ḏ imezḏaɣ ujenna. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Itwasmeḥ-as aḏ iḥareb ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin, aṯen iɣȓeb. Ṯemmuc-as ssulṭa x kuȓ ȓqum ḏ ccaƹb ḏ lluɣa ḏ ȓgens. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Marra imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ aḏas sejjḏen i ȓwaḥc-a, iƹni kuȓ ijjen zzaysen isem nnes war izemmem ca ḏi Lkitab n Ṯuḏarṯ zeg wami ṯeǧa ddunect-a, iƹni ḏi Lkitab n Yizmar itwanɣen. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Ṣenneṭ mliḥ a wenni itsȓan.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Wenni minxef yura aḏ itwaḥebbes, ataf aḏ itwaḥebbes.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Wenni minxef yura aḏ itwaneɣ s ssif, ataf aḏ itwaneɣ s ssif.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Ḏi lḥala nni itxeṣṣa ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin aḏ ṣbaren aḏ amnen.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓwaḥc iy d itgaƹƹaḏen zi ṯmurṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n ȓwaḥc nneɣni iffeɣ-d zi ṯmurṯ, ɣares ṯnayen n waccawen am waccawen n yizmar walakin netta issaweȓ am ddaynaṣur. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Isexḏem marra ssulṭa n ȓwaḥc amezwaru u netta aqaṯ zzaṯes. Yarra marra ṯamurṯ ḏ imezḏaɣ nnes aḏas sejjḏen i ȓwaḥc nni amezwaru iy igenfan zeg ujarriḥ nni n ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Igga lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ ṯimeqqranin, ishewwa-d ṯimessi zeg ujenna ɣar ṯmurṯ zzaṯ i yiwḏan. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Ixeddeƹ imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ s lmuƹjizaṯ nni iy ḏas itwasemḥen aṯent igg zzaṯ i ȓwaḥc <char style="it">amezwaru</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 13:14">Yumar imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ aḏ ṣenƹen ijjen n lʼaṣnam am ȓwaḥc nni iy ḏi iǧa ujarriḥ n ssif walakin netta iddar. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Itwasmeḥ-as aḏ igg buḥbeȓ ḏi lʼaṣnam-a itwaṣenƹen x ṣṣifeṯ n ȓwaḥc <char style="it">amezwaru</char> ḥima aḏ issiweȓ aḏ ineɣ marra yinni war isejjḏen ca i lʼaṣnam-a am ȓwaḥc nni. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Igga bezzez x marra iwḏan s imeqqranen ḏ imezyanen, ḏ twajar ḏ imesƹan, ḏ yinni ɣarsen bab nsen ḏ yinni ɣarsen lḥurriya nsen aḏ ggen ijjen n ṭṭabaƹ x ufus afusi nsen niɣ x ṯenyarṯ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯanyarṯ nettaṯ ḏ ṯawarna.</char></note> nsen. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Uȓa ḏ ijjen war izemmar aḏ iseɣ niɣ aḏ izzenz illa wenni ɣar iǧa ṭṭabaƹ nni, iƹni isem n ȓwaḥc nni niɣ ḏ rraqem n yisem nnes. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Ḏi manaya txeṣṣa ȓefhameṯ. Wenni ɣar iǧa ȓaƹqeȓ aḏ irzu x ȓmaƹna n rraqem n ȓwaḥc-a ȓaḥeqqac netta ḏ rraqem n yijjen n bnaḏem. Rraqem nni netta ḏ settmiyya u setta u settin.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Izmar ḏ yinni iy ṯ iḏeffaren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Wami xzareɣ, twaȓiɣ Izmar ibedd x uḏrar n Lquds akiḏes miyya u arbeƹa u arbeƹin aȓaf. Yura x ṯenyarṯ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯanyarṯ nettaṯ ḏ ṯawarna.</char></note> nsen isem n Yizmar ḏ yisem n Babas. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja zeg ujenna ṯegga am ṣṣut n waṭṭas n waman niɣ am wajjaj ijehḏen. Ƹaweḏ ṯmijja nni umi sȓiɣ ṯegga am ṣṣut n yinni iccaṯen ḏi ṯgambrit. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Tɣennajen ijjen n yizȓi ḏ jḏiḏ zzaṯ i lƹarc ḏ arbeƹa nni n lmexluqaṯ ḏ imɣaren. War izemmar uȓa ḏ ijjen aḏ iȓmeḏ izȓi nni illa ḏ miyya u arbeƹa u arbeƹin aȓaf nni iy itwasnejmen zi ddunect-a. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Yina ḏ yinni war iẓrin ƹemmarṣ ṯimɣarin qqimen ḏ iƹzriyen. Yina ḏ yinni iḏeffaren Izmar mani ma iruḥ. Twasnejmen niṯni zi ȓwesṭ n yiwḏan ḥima aḏ twaqeddmen ḏ imezwura i Arebbi ḏ Yizmar. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Ƹemmarṣ war sxerriqen, niṯni aqaṯen bȓa ȓƹib.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓexbar aṣebḥan n ṯȓaṯa n lmalaʼikaṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n lmalaʼika nneɣni ṯeṭṭaw ḏi ȓwesṭ n ujenna. Ɣares Lʼinjil war ifennin aḏ tbeccar zzayes imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ zi mkuȓ ȓgens ḏ ȓqum ḏ lluɣa ḏ ccaƹb. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Ṯeqqar s jjheḏ: "Ggwḏem Arebbi semɣarem-ṯ, aqa ṯuweḍ-d ṯsaƹƹat nnes aḏ igg lḥisab ḏ lƹiqab. Sejjḏeṯ i wenni iy d ixeȓqen ajenna ḏ ṯmurṯ ḏ ȓebḥar ḏ ȓaƹnaṣer."<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ṯekkar ṯeḏfar-it ijjen n lmalaʼika nneɣni wis ṯnayen ṯeqqar: "Qa ṯewḍa qa ṯewḍa ṯendint n Babil ṯameqqrant ṯenni ig isesswen marra ȓegnus s waman nnes n uḍiȓ, iƹni lfasad nnes ameqqran."<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ṯekkar ṯeḏfar-iṯent ijjen n lmalaʼika nneɣni wis ṯȓaṯa ṯeqqar s jjheḏ: "Wenni ɣa isejjḏen i ȓwaḥc ḏ lʼaṣnam nnes, iqbeȓ ƹaweḏ ṭṭabaƹ x ṯenyarṯ nnes niɣ x ufus nnes, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />ataf aḏ isew zeg waman uḍiȓ iqesḥen ig iǧan ḏ aɣḍab n Arebbi iƹni ḏ ȓkas n lƹiqab nnes. Aḏ iƹeddeb s ṯmessi ḏ ȓekbriyeṯ zzaṯ i lmalaʼikaṯ iṣfan ḏ Yizmar. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Ddexxan n ȓaƹḏab nsen itgaƹƹaḏ i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Yinni isejjḏen i ȓwaḥc ḏ lʼaṣnam nnes qebȓen ƹaweḏ ṭṭabaƹ n yisem nnes ataf war ɣarsen itiȓi bu arraḥeṯ s ǧiȓeṯ niɣ ḏ nhar." <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ḏi lḥala nni itxeṣṣa-yasen i ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin aḏ ṣbaren aḏ ggen array s ȓuṣiyaṯ n Arebbi aḏ amnen zi Ƹisa. <verse eid="REV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja zeg ujenna ṯeqqar: "Ari manaya: Ssaƹḏ n imettinen iy ɣa immṯen ssa aȓ ṯsawent umnen zi Siḏiṯneɣ." Arruḥ n Arebbi iqqar: "Wah, ḥima aḏ reyyḥen zi tamara nsen ȓaḥeqqac ḏeffarent-ṯen lḥasanaṯ nsen."<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓweqṯ n umjar n ṯmurṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Wami xzareɣ, twaȓiɣ ijjen n useynu ḏ acemȓaȓ, wenni xas iqqimen itcabbah ḏi mmis n bnaḏem, x uzeǧif nnes ijjen n ttaj n ddheb, ḏeg ufus nnes ijjen n umjar iqḍeƹ. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Ikkar iffeɣ-d ijjen n lmalak nneɣni zi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant, iqqar-as s jjheḏ i wenni iqqimen x useynu: "Ysi amjar nnec, mjar. Aqa ṯsaƹƹat n umjar ṯuweḍ-d, ṯafeǧaḥṯ n ṯmurṯ qa ṯewjeḏ." <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Wenni iqqimen x useynu yuwṯa s umjar x ṯmurṯ, ṯemjar ṯfeǧaḥṯ nnes.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Ikkar iffeɣ-d ijjen n lmalak nneɣni zi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant iǧan ḏeg ujenna, uȓa ḏ netta ɣares ijjen n umjar iqḍeƹ. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Ikkar iffeɣ-d ijjen n lmalak nneɣni zi ȓmeḏbaḥ n ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ɣares ssulṭa x ṯmessi, iȓaɣa s jjheḏ inna-as i lmalak nni ɣar iǧa umjar iqḍeƹ: "Ysi amjar nnec, jmeƹ-d zzayes izekkunen n ṯzayarṯ n ṯmurṯ ȓaḥeqqac aḍiȓ ṯuweḍ-d ȓweqṯ nnes." <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Lmalak nni yuwṯa s umjar nnes x ṯmurṯ, ijmeƹ-d izekkunen n uḍiȓ n ṯmurṯ inḍar-iṯen ḏi ṯsirṯ ṯameqqrant iy iǧan n uɣḍab n Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Ƹeffsent<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ƹeffes itwaḥsab "ƹjen." Ḏi zman arwin s iḍaren aḍiȓ ḏeg yijjen n ssarij ḥima aḏ d ffɣen waman nnes.</char></note> ḏi ṯsirṯ n uḍiȓ barra i ṯendint. Ḥemȓen-d zzayes iḏammen ar wami d yuwḍen ɣar sȓimeṯ n uyis, uyuren iḏammen nni can ṯeȓtmiyyat kilumit.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Sebƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ ɣarsent sebƹa n lmuṣibaṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n lƹalama nneɣni ḏ ṯameqqrant ḏeg ujenna isḏehhacen, iƹni sebƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ ɣarsent sebƹa n lmuṣibaṯ ṯineggura, zzaysent iy ɣa itwakemmeȓ uɣḍab n Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Ẓriɣ ƹaweḏ amecnaw ȓebḥar n jjaj ixelleṭ ak ṯmessi, bedden xas yinni iɣeȓben ȓwaḥc ḏ lʼaṣnam nnes ḏ rraqem n yisem nnes. Kuȓ ijjen zzaysen ikessi ijjen n ṯgambrit n Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Tɣennajen s yizȓi n Musa ȓƹabḏ n Arebbi ḏ yizȓi n Yizmar qqaren:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="bd">"Ȓexḏayem nnec ḏ ṯimeqqranin isḏehhacen, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="bd">A Siḏi Arebbi nneɣ i kuȓci iy izemmaren.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="bd">Ibriḏen nnec ḏ ȓḥaqq ḏ nican ig iǧan, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">
    <char style="bd">Ay azeǧiḏ n ȓegnus n yiwḏan. </char><verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />
    <char style="bd">A Siḏi, min ƹnan yinni war c iteggwḏen?</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="bd">Min ƹnan yinni isem nnec war ṯ isemɣaren? </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="bd">Aqa cek waḥḏec ig iṣfan. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="bd">Marra ȓegnus aḏ d asen aḏac sejjḏen, </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">
    <char style="bd">minzi ȓexḏayem nnec banent-id nican." </char><verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Menbaƹd i manaya ẓriɣ ṯamziḏa ṯameqqrant iƹni aqiḍun n chaḏeṯ inurzem ḏeg ujenna. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Ffɣent-id zzayes sebƹa-ya n lmalaʼikaṯ ɣarsent lmuṣibaṯ nni s sebƹa. Ggint arruḍ n ȓkettan n lulan iṣfan iȓeqqen, kuȓ icten zzaysent ɣares aḥezzam n ddheb iqḍeƹ-d zeg uɣiȓ ɣar nneṣṣ. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ijjen zi arbeƹa n lmexluqaṯ yuca-asent i sebƹa nni n lmalaʼikaṯ sebƹa n ṯmejmarin ggin-ṯent s ddheb, ƹemmarent s uɣḍab n Arebbi iddaren i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Uca ṯamziḏa ṯameqqrant ṯƹemmar s ddexxan n lƹaḍama n Arebbi ḏ jjheḏ nnes. War izemmar ḥadd aḏ yaḏef ɣar ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ḥetta aȓ ɣa kemmȓent sebƹa-ya n lmuṣibaṯ <char style="it">iy d ɣa sehwant</char> sebƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ nni.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Sebƹa n ṯmejmarin n uɣḍab n Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja ṯendeq-d zi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant ṯeqqar-asent i sebƹa nni n lmalaʼikaṯ s jjheḏ: "Ruḥent zeǧƹent sebƹa n ṯmejmarin n uɣḍab n Arebbi x ṯmurṯ." <verse eid="REV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Ṯekkar ṯeffeɣ-d lmalaʼika ṯamezwarut ṯzeǧeƹ ṯimejmarṯ nnes x ṯmurṯ ffɣent-id ṯḥebba ḏ ṯiƹeffanin ṯinni iy teggent ȓeḥriq ȓeqfent iwḏan nni iy ḏi iǧa ṭṭabaƹ n ȓwaḥc tsejjaḏen i lʼaṣnam nnes.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis ṯnayen ṯzeǧeƹ ṯimejmarṯ nnes ḏi ȓebḥar, ȓebḥar iḏweȓ ḏ iḏammen am iḏammen n wenni immuṯen, min iddaren ḏi ȓebḥar qaƹ immuṯ.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis tȓaṯa ṯzeǧeƹ ṯimejmarṯ nnes x iɣezran ḏ ȓaƹnaṣer n waman ḏewȓen ḏ iḏammen. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Sȓiɣ i lmalaʼika n waman ṯeqqar: "Cek aqac nican ḏi ȓeḥkamaṯ nnec ḏ cek ḏ Lƹaḍim. Ḏ cek ḏ wenni ig iǧan, tuɣa ṯeǧiḏ. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Aqa wami sizzȓen iḏammen n ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin ḏ lʼanbiya, ṯuciḏ-asen aḏ swen iḏammen uȓa ḏ niṯni ȓaḥeqqac sḏaheǧen manayenni."<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṣṣut iqqar-d zi ȓmeḏbaḥ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">"Wah a Siḏi Arebbi nneɣ ig izemmaren i kuȓci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">ȓeḥkamaṯ nnec ḏ ȓḥaqq, aqaṯent nican."<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis arbeƹa ṯzeǧeƹ ṯimejmarṯ nnes x ṯfuct itwasmeḥ-as i ṯfuct aḏ tsecmeḍ iwḏan s ṯmessi. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Cemḍen yiwḏan s lḥarara ijehḏen. Waxxa amenni qqaren awaȓen war iḥȓin ḏeg yisem n Arebbi wenni ɣar ṯeǧa ssulṭa x lmuṣibaṯ-a. War tuben ca, war ṯ semɣaren ca.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis xemsa ṯzeǧeƹ ṯimejmarṯ nnes x lƹarc n ȓwaḥc ṯehwa-d ṯaǧesṯ x lmemlaka nnes. Iwḏan tɣeẓẓaẓen iȓesawen nsen s ȓeḥriq. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Ƹlaḥsab ȓeḥriq ḏ ṯḥebba iy ḏaysen niṯni qqaren awaȓen war iḥȓin x Arebbi iǧan ḏeg ujenna, war tuben ca zi ȓefƹayeȓ nsen.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis setta ṯzeǧeƹ ṯimejmarṯ nnes x yiɣzar n Lfurat ameqqran uzɣen waman iy ḏayes, ḥima aḏ itwassewjeḏ ubriḏ i izeǧiḏen n ccarq. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Ẓriɣ ṯȓaṯa n jnun iƹeffanen ggin am ijerwan:<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ijerwan niṯni ḏ imezyanen tcabbahen ḏeg iqerqriwen.</char></note> ijjen iteffeɣ-d zeg uqemmum n wenni am ddaynaṣur; ijjen iteffeɣ-d zeg uqemmum n ȓwaḥc; ijjen iteffeɣ-d zeg uqemmum n wenni itarran ixef nnes ḏ nnabi. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Yina ḏ arruḥaṯ n ccayaṭin teggen lmuƹjizaṯ <char style="it">zaƹma</char>. Traḥen ɣar izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ marra ḥima aṯen smunen i ȓḥarb ḏi Nhar nni ameqqran n Arebbi ig izemmaren i kuȓci.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />("Ṣennṭeṯ, qa nec aḏ d aseɣ am d yusa ij uceffar. Ssaƹḏ n wenni iy ɣa yiȓin ƹlabal aḏ iḥḍa arruḍ nnes ḥima war iggur ca ḏ aƹeryan aḏ ẓren yiwḏan ṯuƹaryant nnes.")<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Smunen-ṯen ɣar yijjen n umcan s lƹibriya qqaren-as &lt;Harmagidun.&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ṯekkar lmalaʼika wis sebƹa ṯzeǧeƹ ṯimejmarṯ nnes ḏi lhawa sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja zi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant iy d ikkin zi lƹarc ṯeqqar s jjheḏ: "Ṣafi, itwakemmeȓ!" <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Iwqeƹ wassam ḏ iɣuyan ḏ wajjaj ḏ zzinzal ijheḏ. Ƹemmarṣ war iwqiƹ am zzinzal-a ijehḏen zeg wami iǧa bnaḏem x ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Ṯceqq ṯendint ṯameqqrant x tȓaṯa, nheḏment ṯneddam n ȓegnus. War ittu ca Arebbi ṯandint n Babil ṯameqqrant, fa innama yuca-as aḏ tsew zi ȓkas n waman uḍiȓ iƹni lƹiqab nnes ameqqran. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Kuȓ ṯayzirṯ ṯenhezz, fsin iḏurar. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Iwḍa-d icarra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Icarra netta ḏ aḵarra.</char></note> ḏ ameqqran zeg ujenna x yiwḏan, kuȓ abquq iwezzen azyen uqendar. Iwḏan qqaren awaȓen war iḥȓin x Arebbi x ssabab n lmuṣiba-ya n icarra ȓaḥeqqac lmuṣiba-ya ḏ ṯameqqrant aṭṭas.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Lfasda ṯameqqrant ḏ ȓwaḥc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Yusa-d ɣari ijjen zi sebƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ nni iy ɣar ǧant sebƹa n ṯmejmarin inna-ayi: "Araḥ-d, aḏac d smeḍhareɣ lḥisab ḏ lƹiqab n lfasda ṯameqqrant ig iqqimen x waṭṭas n waman. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Fesḏen akiḏes izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ u ƹaweḏ imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ skaren s waman uḍiȓ iƹni lfasad nnes."<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Lmalak nni iysi-ayi arruḥ ɣar ȓexȓa, ẓriɣ ijjen n ṯemɣarṯ ṯenya x yijjen n ȓwaḥc ḏ azeggwaɣ iḥeḏqen iƹemmar s yisemawen war iḥȓin x Arebbi. Ɣares sebƹa n iqeyyuƹen ḏ ƹecra n waccawen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Accawen niṯni ḏ iqaccawen n lḥayawan.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Ṯamɣarṯ-a ṯegga arruḍ ḏ gruna ḏ uzeggwaɣ iḥeḏqen. Ṯzewweq s ddheb ṯegga ṯiƹeqqayin iy iɣȓan ḏ jjuwhar. Ḏeg ufus nnes ijjen n ȓkas n ddheb iƹemmar s ṯuƹuffna ḏ min iǧan ḥram n lfasad nnes. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />X ṯenyarṯ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯanyarṯ nettaṯ ḏ ṯawarna.</char></note> nnes yura ḏinni ijjen n yisem: <char style="bd">Babil Ṯameqqrant, ḏ yemmaṯsent n lfasdaṯ ḏ ṯuƹuffna n ṯmurṯ. </char> Walakin ȓmaƹna nnes war ṯ ifehhem ḥadd.<verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Ẓriɣ ṯamɣarṯ nni ṯsekkar s iḏammen n ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin ḏ iḏammen n yinni icehhḏen x Ƹisa. Wami t ẓriɣ ḏehceɣ aṭṭas. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Inna-ayi lmalak nni: "Mayemmi ṯḏehhaceḏ ammu? Aḏac cerrḥeɣ ȓmaƹna inuffaren n ṯemɣarṯ nni ḏ ȓmaƹna inuffaren n ȓwaḥc nni wenni ɣar iǧa sebƹa n iqeyyuƹen ḏ ƹecra n waccawen iy xef ṯenya. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Ȓwaḥc nni iy ṯeẓriḏ tuɣa iǧa, ȓexxu war iǧi ca, ƹȓayen aḏ d igaƹƹeḏ zi ȓaǧeɣ bȓa ȓaḥedd aḏ itwahḏem. Imezḏaɣ n ṯmurṯ xmi ɣa ẓren ȓwaḥc nni ataf aḏ dehcen iƹni kuȓ ijjen isem nnes war izemmem ca zeg wami ṯeǧa ddunect ḏi Lkitab n Ṯuḏarṯ. Ȓaḥeqqac ȓwaḥc nni tuɣa iǧa, ȓexxu war iǧi ca, ƹaḏ aḏ d yas.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Ḏi manaya labud ȓefhameṯ: Sebƹa n iqeyyuƹen niṯni ḏ sebƹa n iḏurar iy xef ṯeqqim ṯemɣarṯ-a, u ƹaweḏ niṯni ḏ sebƹa n izeǧiḏen. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Xemsa zzaysen wḍan, ijjen iǧa, ijjen ƹaḏ war d yusi ca. Xmi d ɣa yas ataf aḏ iqqim ɣir cwayt n ȓweqṯ waha. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Ȓwaḥc nni iy tuɣa iǧan, ȓexxu war iǧi ca, netta ḏ wis ṯmenya netta ƹaweḏ ḏ ijjen zi sebƹa nni qa iggur aḏ itwahḏem.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Ƹecra nni n waccawen iy ṯeẓriḏ niṯni ḏ ƹecra n izeǧiḏen ƹaḏ war ḏasen ṯemmuc ca ssulṭa aḏ ḥekmen. Aḏasen ṯemmuc ssulṭa aḏ ḥekmen ijjen n ȓweqṯ ḏ ṯamezyant waha ak ȓwaḥc. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Yina tafaqen aḏas ucen i ȓwaḥc jjheḏ nsen ḏ ssulṭa nsen. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Niṯni aḏ ḥarben Izmar walakin netta aṯen iɣȓeb; Qa netta ḏ Mawlana n mawlanaṯ ḏ Azeǧiḏ n izeǧiḏen, yinni iy kiḏes iǧan iȓaɣa-yasen-d Arebbi ixḍar-iṯen, ḏaysen iǧa ȓaman."<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Inna-ayi lmalak nni: "Aman nni iy ṯeẓriḏ mani ṯeqqim lfasda nni, niṯni min ƹnan? Niṯni ḏ iwḏan zi mkuȓ ccaƹb ḏ ȓɣaci ḏ ȓgens ḏ lluɣa. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Ƹecra n waccawen nni iy ṯeẓriḏ u ḏ ȓwaḥc nni aḏ ƹiffen lfasda, aḏas kksen marra min ɣares at jjen ḏ ṯaƹeryant. Aḏ ccen aysum nnes, at sḥerqen s ṯmessi. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Ȓaḥeqqac ḏ Arebbi ig ismunen uȓawen nsen ḥima aḏas ggen ȓxaḍar i Arebbi, iƹni aḏ tafqen aḏas ucen i ȓwaḥc ȓeḥkam nsen ḥetta aȓ iy ɣa twakemmȓen wawaȓen n Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Ṯamɣarṯ nni iy ṯeẓriḏ nettaṯ ḏ ṯandint ṯameqqrant ig iteḥkamen x izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ."<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Ṯandint n Babil ṯweṭṭa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Menbaƹd i manaya ẓriɣ ijjen n lmalak nneɣni ihwa-d zeg ujenna ɣares ssulṭa ḏ ṯameqqrant. Ṯceƹceƹ ṯmurṯ s nnur n lƹaḍama n lmalak nni. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ inna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">"Qa ṯewḍa qa ṯewḍa Babil ṯameqqrant!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">Ṯeḏweȓ ḏ ṯazeddiɣṯ n ccayaṭin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">ḏ ṯanwaȓṯ i mkuȓ jjenn aƹeffan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">ḏ axbuc i mkuȓ ajḍiḍ ig iǧan ḥram ig iƹiffen.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Ȓaḥeqqac marra ȓegnus swin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">zeg waman n uḍiȓ n lfasad nnes war iḥȓi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">fesḏen akiḏes izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">Isebbaben n ṯmurṯ uwin-d aṭṭas n wagȓa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">zeg ufelles nnes ameqqran."<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja nneɣni zeg ujenna ṯeqqar: "Ffɣem zi ṯendint nni ya ccaƹb inu ḥima war ṯcarrcem ca ḏi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnes, ḥima war kenniw teȓqifent ca lmuṣibaṯ nnes.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnes arnint ḥetta aȓ wami uwḍent ɣar ujenna, Arebbi war ittu ca ccarr nnes. <verse eid="REV 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Arrem-as min ḏawem ṯegga nettaṯ, dublam-as ṯnayen n ṯwaȓaṯin ȓefƹayeȓ nnes. Ȓkas nni iy zi ṯsessew i yiwḏan, sesswem-as-ṯ marrṯayen. <verse eid="REV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Mecḥaȓ ma ṯsemɣer ixef nnes, mecḥaȓ ma ṯƹic ḏi ccehweṯ nnes, anectenni iy t ɣa ṯƹeddbem, anectenni iy t ɣa ṯesxeyyqem. Liʼanna nettaṯ ṯeqqar ḏeg wuȓ nnes: Aqa qqimeɣ ḏa am lmalika, nec war ǧiɣ ca ḏ ṯajjaȓṯ, ƹemmarṣ aḏ ḥezneɣ. <verse eid="REV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />X manaya axas d munent ȓmuṣibaṯ ḏeg yijjen n nhar, iƹni ȓmewṯ ḏ lḥuzen ḏ buheyyuf. Aḏ teḥreq s ṯmessi ȓaḥeqqac Siḏi Arebbi iy xas ɣa iḥekmen netta ijheḏ.<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ iy kiḏes ifessḏen iy kiḏes itƹicen ḏi ccehweṯ nnes, axas run axas ḥeznen xmi ɣa ẓren ddexxan n ṯmessi nnes. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Aḏ bedden ɣar ȓeggwaj s ṯiggwḏi n ȓaƹḏab nnes niṯni qqaren: Ya Laṭif, ya Laṭif! Ya ṯandint ṯameqqrant, ya Babil ṯandint ijehḏen! Ḏeg yijjen n ṯsaƹƹat ihwa-d xam lḥisab ḏ lƹiqab!<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Isebbaben n ṯmurṯ axas run axas ḥeznen ȓaḥeqqac sseȓƹaṯ nsen war tifen wi t ɣa isɣen. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Sseȓƹaṯ nni n ddheb, ḏ nnuqarṯ, ḏ lwiz, ḏ jjuwhar, ḏ ȓkettan n lulan aṣebḥan, ḏ ȓkettan gruna, ḏ ȓeḥrir, ḏ ȓkettan azeggwaɣ iḥeḏqen, ḏ marra min itwaṣennƹen s ukeccuḍ n umeḍzi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ameḍzi netta ḏ ȓƹarƹar niɣ ameȓzi. Aqaṯ mujud ḏi Lmeɣrib.</char></note> ḏ marra min itwaṣennƹen s iɣemmuzen n lfil, ḏ marra min itwaṣennƹen s ukeccuḍ iɣran, ḏ nneḥḥas, ḏ ȓeḥḏiḏ, ḏ marmu, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />ḏ ȓqarfa, ḏ lƹiṭar, ḏ tbaxur, ḏ murr,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Murr netta ḏ aman n yijjen n ṯcejjarṯ ḏaysen ȓefwaḥ. Sxeddamen-ṯ i ddwa, teggen-ṯ ƹaweḏ i imettinen xmi ṯen neṭṭȓen.</char></note> ḏ tbaxur lluban, ḏ waman n uḍiȓ, ḏ zzect, ḏ waren lfurs, ḏ yirḏan, ḏ ifunasen, ḏ iḥuȓiyen, ḏ yiysan, ḏ ikarruṯen, ḏ isemɣan iƹni yiwḏan.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />
    <char style="it">Aḏas inin isebbaben:</char> Min ṯƹecceq ccehweṯ nnem war ṯ tifeḏ ca. Marra agȓa ḏ ȓxir nnem aḏ iqḍa, ƹemmarṣ aḏ d iḏweȓ. <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Isebbaben nni iy kiḏes ggin agȓa s sseȓƹaṯ nni aḏ bedden ɣar ȓeggwaj s ṯiggwḏi zi ȓaƹḏab nni, aḏ run aḏ ḥeznen. <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />Aḏ inin: Ya Laṭif, ya Laṭif! Qa ṯandint-a ṯameqqrant, tuɣa xas ȓkettan n lulan aṣebḥan ḏ ȓkettan gruna ḏ ȓkettan azeggwaɣ iḥeḏqen, ṯzewweq ixef nnes s ddheb ṯegga lwiz ḏ jjuwhar! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Iruḥ marra manayenni ḏeg yijjen n ṯsaƹƹat waha!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 18:17" />
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Arruyas n iɣarruba ḏ yinni itsafaren ḏeg uɣarrabu ḏ ibeḥriyen ḏ marra yinni itƹicen zi ȓebḥar bedden ɣar ȓeggwaj, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />xzaren ɣar ddexxan n uḥraq nnes. Qqaren s jjheḏ: Man ṯandint ig iǧan nettaṯ am ṯendint-a ṯameqqrant? <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Neṭṭaren caȓ x izeǧifen nsen, sɣuyiwen, trun, ḥezznen, qqaren: Ya Laṭif, ya Laṭif n ṯendint ṯameqqrant! Ayṯbab n iɣarruba ḏi ȓebḥar tuɣa ḏewȓen ḏ twajar liʼanna ṯandint ḏayes agȓa aṭṭas! Ḏeg yijjen n ṯsaƹƹat kuȓci iruḥ!<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Ay ajenna, fareḥ x uhḏam nnes. Farḥem a ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin ḏ arrusul ḏ lʼanbiya! Aqa iḥaseb-it Arebbi x min ḏawem ṯegga."<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Ijjen n lmalak ijheḏ iysi-d ijjen n uzru igga am uzru n ṯsirṯ ṯameqqrant, inḍar-iṯ ḏi ȓebḥar inna: "Ammu s jjheḏ iy ɣa ṯmenḍar Babil ṯandint ṯameqqrant, war itiȓi ca ƹemmarṣ. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Zi ssa aȓ ṯsawent ƹemmarṣ aḏayem tesȓan i ṣṣut n imeḏyazen ḏ yinni iccaṯen ḏi ṯgambrit ḏ yinni itṣuḍen ḏi zzammar ḏ ṯemja.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯamja nettaṯ ḏ lɣiṭa niɣ ḏ ṯacebbabṯ.</char></note> Ƹemmarṣ aḏayem yiȓin yinni itṣennaƹen mammec ma ṯegga ṣṣenƹaṯ nsen. Ƹemmarṣ aḏayem tesȓan i ṣṣut n ṯsirṯ. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Ƹemmarṣ aḏayem ṯceƹƹeȓ ṯfawṯ n ȓqendiȓ. Ƹemmarṣ aḏayem tesȓan i ṣṣut n muȓay ḏ ṯsȓiṯ. Aqa isebbaben nnem tuɣa ǧan ḏ imeqqranen n ṯmurṯ, s ssiḥer nnem ṯxeḏƹeḏ marra ȓegnus.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Iwa ḏi ṯendint-a ig ufin iḏammen n lʼanbiya ḏ ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin ḏ marra yinni itwanɣen ḏi ṯmurṯ."<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s">Ssaƹḏ n yinni itwaƹarḍen ɣar umensi n ȓfarḥ n Yizmar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Menbaƹd i manaya sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja amecnaw ṣṣut n waṭṭas n yiwḏan iǧan ḏeg ujenna, ṯeqqar s jjheḏ: "Ḥemḏeṯ Arebbi!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ḥemḏeṯ Arebbi, iƹni s wawaȓ n Ayṯ-Israʼil Halliluya!</char></note> Asenjem ḏ lƹaḍama ḏ jjheḏ i Arebbi nneɣ.<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Ȓeḥkam nnes ḏ ȓḥaqq iǧa nican. Iḥaseb lfasda ṯameqqrant ig isefsaḏen ṯamurṯ s lfasad nnes, intaqem zzayes ƹlaḥsab iḏammen n yinni iƹebbḏen Arebbi."<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Nnan ṯwara wis ṯnayen: "Ḥemḏeṯ Arebbi! Ddexxan nnes itgaƹƹaḏ i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ."<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Arbeƹa u ƹicrin n imɣaren ḏ arbeƹa n lmexluqaṯ sejjḏen i Arebbi iqqimen x lƹarc, qqaren: "Amin! Ḥemḏeṯ Arebbi!"<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Ṯusa-d ijjen n ṯmijja zi lƹarc ṯeqqar: "Ḥemḏeṯ Arebbi ya lƹibad nnes marra, a yinni ṯ iteggwḏen s umezyan ḏ umeqqran!"<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṣṣut am ṣṣut n waṭṭas n ȓɣaci niɣ am ṣṣut n waṭṭas n waman niɣ am ṣṣut n wajjaj ijehḏen, iqqar: "Ḥemḏeṯ Arebbi! Siḏi Arebbi nneɣ ig izemmaren i kuȓci qa iḥekkem.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Yallahem a nfarḥeṯ, a nezhuṯ, aṯ nsemɣareṯ! Ȓfarḥ n Yizmar aqa yuweḍ-d, ṯasȓiṯ nnes qa ṯsewjeḏ ixef nnes.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Immuc-as axas ṯegg ȓkettan n lulan aṣebḥan, ireqq, iṣfa."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:8">(Ȓkettan n lulan aṣebḥan iƹni netta ḏ ȓexḏayem ig iǧan nican n ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Inna-ayi lmalak wenni: "Ari manaya: Ssaƹḏ n yinni itwaƹarḍen ɣar umensi n ȓfarḥ n Yizmar!" Inna-ayi ƹaweḏ: "Awaȓen-a ǧan ḏ ṣṣaḥ zi Arebbi." <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Uḍiɣ-as ɣar iḍaren nnes ḥima aḏas sejjḏeɣ. Indeq-d inna-ayi: "Lla! Qa nec ḏ ȓƹabḏ am nec am cek am ayṯmac iy ṭṭfen x minxef icheḏ Ƹisa. Sejjeḏ-as i Arebbi! Ȓaḥeqqac minxef icheḏ Ƹisa netta ḏ arruḥ n l'anbiya."<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ljumla-ya, ȓmaƹna nnes ȓḥaqq ig ismeḍhar Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa netta ḏ jjheḏ nni ig iƹawnen iwḏan aḏ inin awaȓ n Arebbi.</char></note><verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wenni inyin x uyis ḏ acemȓaȓ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Ẓriɣ ajenna inurzem ḏinni ijjen n uyis ḏ acemȓaȓ, wenni xas inyin qqaren-as Ȓaman ḏ ȓḥaqq. Itḥasab itḥarab s ȓḥaqq. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Ṯiṭṭawin nnes am uḥaḏuq n ṯmessi, x uzeǧif nnes aṭṭas n ttajaṯ. Yura xas ijjen n yisem war ṯ issin ḥadd illa netta. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Igga xas ijjen n čammir iɣeḍsen ḏeg iḏammen, s yisem tȓaɣan-as Awaȓ n Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Ȓƹaskar n ujenna ḏeffaren-ṯ nyin x yiysan ḏ icemȓaȓen, ggin arruḍ n ȓkettan n lulan aṣebḥan ḏ acemȓaȓ inqa. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Iteffeɣ-d zeg uqemmum nnes ijjen n ssif iqḍeƹ, azzayes yuweṯ ȓegnus. Netta aṯen yarwes s uƹekkaz n ȓeḥḏiḏ, axasen iƹeffes<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ƹeffes itwaḥsab "ƹjen." Ḏi zman arewwin aḍiȓ s iḍaren ḏeg yijjen n ssarij ḥima aḏ d ffɣen waman nnes.</char></note> ḏi ṯsirṯ n waman n uḍiȓ iƹni ḏ lƹiqab ameqqran n Arebbi ig izemmaren i kuȓci. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Yura x učammir ḏ umeṣṣaḍ nnes ijjen n yisem iƹni ḏ Azeǧiḏ n izeǧiḏen ḏ Mawlana n mawlanaṯ.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n lmalak ibedd x ṯfucṯ, isnekkar ṯɣuyyeṯ s jjheḏ iqqar-asen i marra ijḍaḍ iṭṭawen ḏi ȓwesṭ n ujenna: "Araḥem-d, muneṯ ɣar umensi ameqqran n Arebbi <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />ḥima aḏ teccem aysum n izeǧiḏen ḏ uysum n arruyas n ȓƹaskar ḏ uysum n yinni ijehḏen ḏ uysum n yiysan ḏ yinni xasen inyin ḏ uysum n marra iwḏan iƹni ḏ yinni ɣar iǧa bab nsen ḏ yinni ɣar ṯeǧa lḥurriya nsen, s umezyan ḏ umeqqran."<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Ẓriɣ ȓwaḥc ḏ izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ ḏ ȓƹaskar nsen njemƹen ḥima aḏ ḥarben wenni inyin x uyis ḏ ȓƹaskar nnes. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Itwaṭṭef ȓwaḥc ḏ ameḥbus, akiḏes wenni itarran ixef nnes ḏ nnabi iy tuɣa iteggen lmuƹjizaṯ zzaṯ i ȓwaḥc. S lmuƹjizaṯ nni ixḏeƹ yinni iy ḏi iǧa ṭṭabaƹ n ȓwaḥc tsejjaḏen-as i lʼaṣnam nnes. Ȓwaḥc ḏ wenni itarran ixef nnes ḏ nnabi menḍaren s ṯnayen iḏsen ḏi ȓebḥar n ṯmessi ireqqen s ȓekbriyeṯ u niṯni aqaṯen ƹaḏ s buḥbeȓ nsen. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Ssif nni iy d iffɣen zeg uqemmum n wenni inyin x uyis inɣa marra yinni iqqimen, usin-d yijḍaḍ jjiwnen marra zeg uysum nsen.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Cciṭan itwaqqen aȓaf n iseggwusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n lmalak ihwa-d zeg ujenna ɣares ḏeg ufus nnes ȓmeftaḥ n ȓaǧeɣ bȓa ȓaḥedd ḏ yijjen n ssensȓeṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Iṭṭef wenni iggin am ddaynaṣur netta ḏ fiɣer nni n zman iƹni Ibȓis niɣ ḏ Cciṭan, iqqen-iṯ iḥbes-iṯ aȓaf n iseggwusa. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Inḍar-iṯ ḏi ȓaǧeɣ bȓa ȓaḥedd, ibelleƹ xas <char style="it">ṯawwarṯ</char> icemmeƹ-it bac ssenni aȓ ṯsawent war ixeddeƹ ca ȓegnus aȓ ɣa kemmȓen aȓaf n iseggwusa nni. Menbaƹd i manayenni labud aḏ itwaḍȓeq cwayt n ȓweqṯ.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Ẓriɣ lƹarcaṯ ḏ yinni xasen iqqimen ṯemmuc-asen ssulṭa aḏ ḥekmen. Ẓriɣ buḥbeȓ n yinni umi itwaqessen izeǧifen liʼanna ḏeffaren minxef icheḏ Ƹisa ḏ wawaȓ n Arebbi. Niṯni tuɣaṯen war sejjḏen ca i ȓwaḥc niɣ i lʼaṣnam nnes, tuɣa war qbiȓen ca ṭṭabaƹ nnes x ṯenyarṯ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯanyarṯ nettaṯ ḏ ṯawarna.</char></note> nsen niɣ x ufus nsen. Kkaren-d zi ȓmewṯ ḥekmen ak Ƹisa aȓaf n iseggwusa. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Manayenni ḏ lqiyama ṯamezwarut. Imettinen nneɣni war d tekkaren ca zi ȓmewṯ ḥetta aȓ ɣa kemmȓen aȓaf n iseggwusa. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Yinni d ɣa ikkaren ḏi lqiyama ṯamezwarut ssaƹḏ nsen, aqaṯen ṣfan. Ȓmewṯ wis ṯnayen war ɣares tiȓi ca ssulṭa xasen. Aḏ iȓin ḏ ȓfuqaha n Arebbi ḏ Lmasiḥ, akiḏes ḥekmen aȓaf n iseggwusa.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cciṭan itwanḍar ḏi ȓebḥar n ṯmessi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Xmi ɣa kemmȓen aȓaf n iseggwusa nni, aḏ d itwaḍȓeq Cciṭan zi ȓeḥbes nnes. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Aḏ d iffeɣ aḏ ixḏeƹ ȓegnus x arbeƹa n jwayeh n ṯmurṯ, iƹni Hajuj u Majuj. Aṯen ismun aḏ ḥarben, lƹadad nsen igga am yijḏi n ȓebḥar.<verse eid="REV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Nfeyyḍen-d <char style="it">Hajuj u Majuj</char> x ṯmurṯ amen-ṯekmaȓ, nnḍen mani ƹezzben ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin iƹni ṯandint nni iƹizzen. Ȓexddenni ṯehwa-d xasen ṯmessi zeg ujenna ṯecc-iṯen. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Ibȓis nni iy ṯen ixeḏƹen imenḍar-d ḏi ȓebḥar nni n ṯmessi ḏ ȓekbriyeṯ mani iǧa ȓwaḥc nni ḏ wenni itarran ixef nnes ḏ nnabi. Aḏ twaƹeddben ḏinni nhar ḏ ǧiȓeṯ i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yum Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n lƹarc ḏ acemȓaȓ ḏ ameqqran. Wenni xas iqqimen ṯarweȓ zzayes ṯmurṯ ḏ ujenna war ḏasen iqqim bu umcan. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Ẓriɣ imettinen bedden zzaṯ i lƹarc nni am umezyan am umeqqran. Nurzmen Lkutub, inurzem ijjen n Lkitab nneɣni netta ḏ Lkitab n Ṯuḏarṯ. Twaḥasben imettinen s min yurin ḏi Lkutub ƹlaḥsab ȓexḏayem nsen. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Ȓebḥar isellem imettinen ig icca. Ȓmewṯ ḏ Lʼaxira sellment imettinen nsent. Uca kuȓ ijjen aḏ itwaḥaseb ƹlaḥsab ȓexḏayem nnes. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Ṯmenḍar-d ȓmewṯ ḏ Lʼaxira ḏi ȓebḥar n ṯmessi. Qa ȓebḥar nni n ṯmessi netta ig iǧan ḏ ȓmewṯ wis ṯnayen. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Wenni war ɣar ufin ca isem nnes izemmem ḏi Lkitab n Ṯuḏarṯ qa imenḍar-d ḏi ȓebḥar n ṯmessi.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Ijjen n ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ ḏ jḏiḏ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Ẓriɣ ijjen n ujenna ḏ jḏiḏ ḏ ijjen n ṯmurṯ ḏ jḏiḏ, ȓaḥeqqac ajenna amezwaru ḏ ṯmurṯ ṯamezwarut ṣafi twakksen, ȓebḥar war iqqim ca. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Ẓriɣ ṯandint iqeddsen nettaṯ ḏ Lquds ḏ jḏiḏ. Ṯehwa-d zeg ujenna zi Arebbi ṯegga am ṯsȓiṯ ṯeƹḏeȓ ixef nnes bac aḏ teȓqa muȓay. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Sȓiɣ i yijjen n ṯmijja zi lƹarc ṯeqqar s jjheḏ: "Aqa ṯazeddiɣṯ n Arebbi ak yiwḏan, aḏ izḏeɣ jarasen aḏ iȓin ḏ ccaƹb nnes. Arebbi s yixef nnes akiḏsen yiȓi, u ƹaweḏ aḏ yiȓi ḏ Arebbi nsen. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Aḏ imseḥ kuȓ ameṭṭaw zi ṯiṭṭawin nsen. War tɣimi ca ƹaḏ ȓmewṯ niɣ ḏ lḥuzen niɣ ḏ imeṭṭawen niɣ ḏ ȓeḥriq. Aqa ṯimesȓayin nni ṯimezwura ṣafi twakksent."<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Inna-ayi wenni iqqimen x lƹarc: "Aḏ ggeɣ kuȓci ḏ jḏiḏ!" Uca inna: "Ari manaya qa awaȓen-a ḏaysen ȓaman ḏaysen ȓḥaqq." <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Inna-ayi: "Ṣafi, itwakemmeȓ. Nec ḏ lʼalif nec ḏ lyaʼ. Nec kuȓci zzayi ig ibḏa, nec kuȓci zzayi iy ɣa ikemmeȓ. Aḏ uceɣ i wenni iffuḏen zi ȓƹunṣar n waman n ṯuḏarṯ baṭeȓ. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Wenni ɣa irebḥen aḏ iwareṯ ḏi ṯmesȓayin-a. Nec aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ Arebbi nnes, netta aḏ yiȓi ḏ mmi. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Walakin ccmayeṯ ḏ yinni war yuminen ca ḏ yinni iǧan ḏ iƹeffanen ḏ yinni ineqqen iwḏan ḏ yinni ifessḏen ḏ iseḥḥaren ḏ yinni iƹebbḏen lʼaṣnam ḏ marra yinni isxerriqen aqa amcan nsen aḏ yiȓi ḏi ȓebḥar ireqqen s ṯmessi ḏ ȓekbriyeṯ. Qa ṯenni ḏ ȓmewṯ wis ṯnayen."<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṯandint n Lquds ḏ jḏiḏ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Yusa-d ɣari ijjen zi sebƹa n lmalaʼikaṯ nni iy ɣar ǧant sebƹa n ṯmejmarin ig iƹemmaren s sebƹa n lmuṣibaṯ nni ṯineggura, inna-ayi: "Araḥ-d, aḏac d smeḍhareɣ ṯasȓiṯ, iƹni ṯenni ɣa yawin Izmar." <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Iysi-ayi arruḥ ɣar yijjen n uḏrar ḏ ameqqran yuƹȓa, ismeḍhar-ayi-d ṯandint iqeddsen iƹni Lquds, ṯehwa-d zeg ujenna zi Arebbi. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Ḏayes lƹaḍama n Arebbi, nnur nnes amecnaw ṯazrut ṯaṣebḥant, amecnaw ṯazrut n lyaceb ṯeṣfa aṭṭas. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Ɣares ijjen n ȓḥiḍ ḏ ameqqran yuƹȓa ɣares ṯenƹac n ṯewwura, ṯenƹac n ṯewwura nni xasent ṯenƹac n lmalaʼikaṯ. Yura x ṯewwura nni isemawen n ṯenƹac n ṯqebbaȓ n Ayṯ-Israʼil. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Ḏi ccarq ṯȓaṯa n ṯewwura, ḏi ccamal ṯȓaṯa n ṯewwura, ḏi ljanub ṯȓaṯa n ṯewwura, ḏi ȓɣarb ṯȓaṯa n ṯewwura. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Ȓḥiḍ n ṯendint ibedd x ṯenƹac n dsasaṯ, yura xasen isemawen n ṯenƹac n arrusul n Yizmar.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Lmalak nni wenni iy ɣari d issiwȓen ɣares ḏeg ufus nnes ijjen n ȓaƹbar n uɣanim n ddheb iƹebbar zzayes ṯandint ḏ ṯiwwura nnes ḏ ȓḥiḍ nnes. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ṯandint murebbaƹ, am ṯuzeggarṯ nnes am ṯiriwṯ nnes. Iƹbar ṯandint s uɣanim nni yufa ḏayes aȓefayen u arbeƹmiyyat n kilumit, am ṯuzeggarṯ nnes am ṯiriwṯ nnes am ṯuƹȓat nnes. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Iƹbar ȓḥiḍ nnes yufa ḏayes miyya u arbeƹa u arbeƹin n ḏerraƹ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ijjen setta y settin miter.</char></note> iƹni ȓaƹbar n lmalak nni am ȓaƹbar n bnaḏem. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Ȓḥiḍ nnes ibna s ṯezra n lyaceb, ṯandint ṯebna s ddheb iṣfan amecnaw jjaj iṣfan. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Dsasaṯ n ȓḥiḍ n ṯendint zewwqen s mkuȓ nnuƹ n ṯezra ṯiṣebḥanin. Dsas amezwaru netta ḏ ṯazrut n lyaceb, dsas wis ṯnayen ḏ lyaqut azeyza, dsas wis ṯȓaṯa ḏ lƹaqiq acemȓaȓ, dsas wis arbeƹa ḏ ṯazrut ṯazeyzawṯ n zzumurrud, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />dsas wis xemsa ḏ jjazeƹ azeggwaɣ, dsas wis setta ḏ lƹaqiq azeggwaɣ, dsas wis sebƹa ḏ ṯazrut n zzabarjad, dsas wis ṯmenya ḏ ṯazrut n birril, dsas wis tesƹa ḏ lyaqut awraɣ, dsas wis ƹecra ḏ lƹaqiq amerbiƹ, dsas wis ḥiṭac ḏ ṯazrut n fayruz, dsas wis ṯenƹac ḏ ṯazrut n jjamact. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Ṯenƹac nni n ṯewwura niṯenti ḏ ṯenƹac n jjuwharaṯ, kuȓ ṯawwarṯ nettaṯ ḏ jjuwhar. Ccariƹ n ṯendint netta ḏ ddheb iṣfan amecnaw jjaj iṣfan.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />War ẓriɣ ca Ṯamziḏa ṯameqqrant ḏi ṯendint nni, mayemmi? Liʼanna Siḏi Arebbi ig izemmaren i kuȓci ak Yizmar niṯni ig iǧan ḏ Ṯamziḏa-ya ṯameqqrant. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Ṯandint-a war teḥḏiji ca ṯfawṯ n ṯfucṯ niɣ n ṯziri ȓaḥeqqac lƹaḍama n Arebbi nettaṯ iy iteggen ḏinni ṯfawṯ, Izmar ḏ netta ḏ ȓefnar nnes. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Aḏ uyuren ȓegnus ḏi ṯfawṯ nnes, qa izeǧiḏen n ṯmurṯ aḏ siḏfen lhimma nsen ḏi <char style="it">ṯendint-a</char>. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Ṯiwwura nnes war tbelliƹent ca nhar ikmaȓ qaƹ ȓaḥeqqac war ḏinni bu ǧiȓeṯ. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Ḏinni aḏ siḏfen lhimma ḏ uweqqar n ȓegnus. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />War ḏinni taḏef uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ ṯwessex niɣ ḏ ikrucaren niɣ ḏ yinni iqqaren ixerriqen. Aḏ aḏfen ḏinni ɣir yinni ɣar ǧan isemawen nsen zemmmen ḏi Lkitab n Ṯuḏarṯ n Yizmar.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Ismeḍhar-ayi-d lmalak nni iɣzar n waman n ṯuḏarṯ ṣfan am jjaj, iteffeɣ-d zi lƹarc n Arebbi ḏ Yizmar <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />itazzeȓ ḏi ȓwesṭ n ccariƹ n ṯendint. X ṯnayen n iɣezḏisen n yiɣzar-a ḏinni ṯacejjarṯ n ṯuḏarṯ. Tarew ṯenƹac n ṯwaȓaṯin kuȓ char ijjen n ṯwaȓa, afar nnes isgenfa ȓegnus. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Zi ssenni aȓ ṯsawent war ḏinni tiȓi bu nnaƹȓeṯ. Lƹarc n Arebbi ḏ Yizmar aḏ yiȓi ḏi ṯendint-a, aṯ ƹebḏen lƹibad nnes. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Aḏ ẓren aɣembub nnes, isem nnes aqaṯ x ṯenyarṯ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯanyarṯ nettaṯ ḏ ṯawarna.</char></note> nsen. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Zi ssenni aȓ ṯsawent war ḏinni tiȓi bu ǧiȓeṯ, war teḥḏijin ca ṯfawṯ n ȓefnar niɣ ḏ ṯfawṯ n ṯfuct ȓaḥeqqac Siḏi Arebbi netta axasen igg ṯfawṯ nnes. Aḏ ḥekmen i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa itas-d</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Inna-ayi lmalak wenni: "Awaȓen-a ḏaysen ȓaman ḏaysen ȓḥaqq. Arebbi netta ḏ Mawlana iy d isehwan lwaḥi x lʼanbiya, issekk-d lmalak nnes ḥima aḏ d ismeḍhar i yinni iy ṯ iƹebbḏen min labud ɣa iweqƹen ƹȓayen."<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />"Nec aqa usiɣ-d war tƹeṭṭaȓeɣ ca! Ssaƹḏ n yinni iteggen array i wawaȓen n lwaḥi iǧan ḏi Lkitab-a."<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Ḏ nec Yuḥanna iy sȓiɣ, ẓriɣ ṯimesȓayin-a. Wami sȓiɣ, ẓriɣ manaya, hwiɣ aḏ sejjḏeɣ ɣar iḍaren n lmalak nni iy ḏayi d ismeḍharen ṯimesȓayin-a. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Inna-ayi: "Lla! Qa nec ḏ ȓƹabḏ, am nec am cek am ayṯmac lʼanbiya ḏ marra yinni iteggen array i wawaȓen n Lkitab-a. Sejjeḏ-as i Arebbi."<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Inna-ayi: "War snuffar ca awaȓen-a n lwaḥi ḏi Lkitab-a ȓaḥeqqac ȓweqṯ ṯuḏes-d. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Wenni iteggen ccarr aḏ iqqim itegg ccarr. Wenni ixenzen aḏ iqqim itexniz. Wenni iǧan nican aḏ iqqim nican. Wenni iǧan ḏ amqeddes aḏ iqqim ḏ amqeddes."<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />
    <char style="it">Inna Ƹisa:</char> "Nec aqa usiɣ-d war tƹeṭṭaȓeɣ ca! Aḏ d awiɣ texȓiseṯ, aḏ jaziɣ kuȓ ijjen ƹlaḥsab ȓexḏayem nnes. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Nec ḏ lʼalif nec ḏ lyaʼ, nec ḏ amezwaru ḏ aneggaru. Nec kuȓci zzayi ig ibḏa, kuȓci zzayi iy ɣa ikemmeȓ. <verse eid="REV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Ssaƹḏ n yinni itṣebbanen ičammiren nsen, ḥima aɣarsen yiȓi ȓḥaqq ḏi ṯcejjarṯ n ṯuḏarṯ aḏ aḏfen ṯandint zi ṯewwura nnes. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ɣar barra n ṯendint ǧan ḏinni iqzinen ḏ iseḥḥaren ḏ yinni ifessḏen ḏ yinni ineqqen iwḏan ḏ yinni iƹebbḏen lʼaṣnam ḏ marra yinni isxerriqen iy tḥibban ixarriqen.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Ḏ nec Ƹisa ssekkeɣ-d lmalak inu ḥima aḏawem icheḏ x ṯmesȓayin-a ḏi ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin. Nec ḏ lʼaṣel n Dawed u zi ddurriṯ nnes. Nec ḏ iṯri n ȓefjar itceƹciƹen."<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Arruḥ ḏ ṯsȓiṯ qqaren: "Araḥ-d!" Wenni itsȓan aḏ yini: "Araḥ-d!" Wenni ifuḏen aḏ d yas, wenni irezzun aman n ṯuḏarṯ aḏ isew baṭeȓ!<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Cehhḏeɣ nec x marra yinni itsȓan i wawaȓen-a n lwaḥi ḏi Lkitab-a: Wenni xasen ɣa yarnin, ataf Arebbi as yarni lmuṣibaṯ iy d yusin ḏi Lkitab-a. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Wenni ɣa ikksen zeg wawaȓen-a n lwaḥi ḏi Lkitab-a, ataf Arebbi as ikkes ȓḥaqq nnes zi ṯmesȓayin ig yurin ḏi Lkitab-a, iƹni ȓḥaqq nnes n ṯcejjarṯ n ṯuḏarṯ ḏ ȓḥaqq nnes n ṯendint iqeddsen.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Iqqar Ƹisa iƹni wenni ixebbaren x ṯmesȓayin-a: "Wah, nec aqa usiɣ-d war tƹeṭṭaȓeɣ ca!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amin, araḥ-d a Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa.<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Aḏ yiȓi arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ak kuȓ ijjen. Amin.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>